    "description": "Enjoy a beutiful boat ride from Dubrovnik to Cavtat where you will have the opportunity to experience wine tasting in Karaman winery. \r\n\r\nKaraman Winery is a family-owned estate in the heart of Konavle, where centuries of winemaking tradition meet passion, expertise, and deep respect for the land.\r\n\r\nOur focus is Malvasia Dubrovačka, a native grape with rich heritage and great potential. From our vineyards, we craft two signature wines: a fresh, elegant dry white and prošek – a traditional dessert wine known for its full body and aromatic depth.\r\n\r\nhttps://malvasija-karaman.com/",
