    "description": "Discover Prague on board of a vintage car where your driver tells you stories of the city and lets you look under the cover of the magic. The vintage car tours may be organized per your request but we recommend them to start in the very city centre from where you are free to spread your wings at will. The tours are good for 1 or 2 hours and our proposal is to end up at a very particular point – Salabka Winery. Here, you feel free to enjoy a wine tasting tour of the local vineyards as well as a great culinary experience by exploring the local tasting menu with carefully selected wines at Salabka Winery.\r\n\r\nSalabka Winery is no doubt one a remarkable place allowing you to forget that you are in a city. Most probably named after Jan Kaspar Salaba, its founder, it has stood the test of time, returning into private hands in 1989. Its present design and services are result of tremendous effort that finished here in 2014. Since then, Salabka is a popular setting offering a modern winery, a restaurant with a terrace, apartments in the style of French vineyard houses and a fine Prague distillery. Activities here include a wine tasting tour of the local vineyards, picnic in the local vineyards (weather permitting) and a tasting menu paired with carefully selected wines. ​ \r\n\r\nYour transfer back to the city centre may be arranged via vintage cars again to make your experience second to none.​",
