    "description": "Try to discover Prague Old Town in a very particular way – looking for house signs that were used in the city prior to introduction of street numeric system!\r\n\r\nYou simply split into several teams of participants based on random draw and become explorers of locations within the Old Town of Prague according to the given itinerary. \r\n\r\nThe itinerary may include house signs but also street names or particular buildings. Make sure to take a photo of your team at each discovered location as a proof.\r\n\r\nUse a map provided to you by the organisers, use your mobile if you like but do your best to visit all places you have on your task list. \r\n\r\nAt the end of the day, everyone is a winner, and no doubt you will proudly make the other teams familiar with your discoveries! ​",
