    "description": "Located in the historic center of Prague between Old Town Square and Wenceslas Square, IAM Illusion Art Museum Prague offers a playful and interactive journey into the world of optical illusions, trick art, and immersive installations.\r\n\r\nSet inside a beautiful neo-Renaissance building, the museum combines art, entertainment, and modern technology in a unique experience suitable for visitors of all ages.\r\n\r\nThe museum features a wide variety of interactive exhibits, anamorphic installations, 3D artworks, augmented reality experiences, and illusion-based displays created by Czech and international artists. \r\n\r\nVisitors are encouraged not only to observe the exhibits, but also to interact with them, creating memorable and often humorous photo opportunities.",
