    "description": "Toosikannu Holiday Centre is perfect for a holiday!\r\n\r\nMany activities in nature are possible for everyone. The largest Deer Garden and Animal Park in Estonia are located here. Wild animal safari is very popular activity. The bigger part of the park is a 928 ha fenced-in garden, inhabited by animals such as elk, roe deer, red deer, raccoon dogs.\r\n\r\nThere are also many other activities such as archery, forest hike, hunting, snowmobile trip, snowshoe hikes, hornwork handicrafts, shooting exercises.\r\n\r\nToosikannu offers a varied selection of dishes made from wild game living in Estonia. \r\n\r\nFestive dinners from deer and elk meat can be ordered all year round. After a lovely hike or activity and a delicious game meal, you can relax in a sauna: there is Russian, Finnish, and Smoke Sauna (UNESCO), as well as a hot tub.​",
