    "description": "The Helsinki Distilling Company became operational in 2014 as the first distillery in Helsinki. \r\n\r\nThe two-storied historic building‚ at ground floor houses the distillery where premium gin, whiskey and other spirits from the best local ingredients are hand-crafted.  On the first floor is an excellent cocktail bar and kitchen called Tislaamo – Distillery Bar.\r\n\r\nOn this guided tour we invite you to have a tasting of the most  popular spirits. The Tour of the distillery includes a detailed explanation of the steps involved in making whiskey, gin and applejack (approx. 45 min).\r\n\r\nThe guided tour may be topped with a guided tasting (approx. 30min) during which you will get to taste 4 of their released products (3x2cl and a Helsinki Long Drink)\r\n\r\nPRIVATE TOURS (in English): Private distillery tours can be booked from Wednesday to Saturday\r\n\r\nOnly for adults (18+)",
