    "description": "Over breaking ice or snow, this tour heads for the empty archipelago deep frozen in a Hovercraft! Experience how it feels floating between ice staying warm and dry.\r\n\r\nThis arctic Helsinki day trip starts just outside Helsinki at the Hovercraft departure pier. \r\n\r\nAfter safety instructions, your hovercraft leaves from the east side of Helsinki into the empty archipelago deep frozen. After a winter nature walk you can wear a survival suit and experience how it feels floating among ice rafts staying warm and dry.\r\n\r\nRunning on floating ice rafts is great fun too! \r\n\r\nThe swim is, of course, completely voluntary and you can also stay ashore taking great pictures of the other swimmers. Duration of the swim is 15-45 minutes. \r\n\r\nA Barbecue lunch on open fire is a perfect end to a perfect day. \r\nDeparture point may vary due to weather conditions.\r\n\r\nNote: Additional transfers by coach to activity location needed.",
