    "description": "Cycling in Helsinki is for the most part just as easy and fun as anywhere else, plus you get to see and experience a lot more from the saddle. Explore the most scenic parts of Helsinki in a unique new way during this tour, invigorating eco-tour via bicycle.\r\n\r\nDepart by private coach to the activity location. Meet your ciclying guide and start a scenic, approximate three hour bicycle tour through the heart of the beautiful city of Helsinki. Along the way, cycle through green areas and parks, pass by museums, admire the sea and feel the spirit of the Downtown area.\r\n\r\nBicycling along mostly flat paths, discover many of Helsinki's highlights and admire the city's waterfront beauty.  \r\n\r\nTour ends at agreed location. Transfer back to your hotel by private coach.",
