    "description": "Vallisaari is an island next to Suomenlinna and it can be visited in May-Sep with the waterbus operating from Market Square.\r\n\r\nVallisaari used to be a military area but opened to the public some 5 years ago. This island can be considered as nature lovers’ paradise as there we can find almost untouched nature and some plant species which cannot be found elsewhere in Finland.\r\n\r\nVisitors can explore the island on their own as there are several marked walking paths but also guided walking tours are available. There are a few small cafes and summer restaurants on the island.",
