    "description": "Hartwall Ltd is a beverage company, which was founded in 1836 in Finland. Their product range includes water, soft drinks, speciality drinks, beers, ciders and long drinks as well as wines and other alcoholic beverage. Their best-known brands are Hartwall Original Long Drink, Harwall Jaffa, Hartwal NOvelle, Lapin Kulta and Lahten Erikois. They are also a partner of the Heineken and Pepsi brands in Finland. \r\n\r\nIn Lahti, there is a Hartwall's own factory store, where you can buy their refershing drinks to take home, from water to special beers, and from novelties to classics that everyone loves. \r\nThe Hartwall visitor centre operates in the same connection with the brewery store, wher you can see what is being done at Hartwall. In the 1-hour tour, they will tell about their activities, their high-quality products using local ingredients.\r\nIn addition, the tour dives into Hartwall's its more than 180-year history. \r\n\r\nThe visitor centre has an auditorium for meetings and the Panimon kellari restaurant for delicious gatherings and tastings.",
