    "description": "Teerenpeli Brewery was founded in Lahti, Finland in 1995. It was one of the first microbreweries in Finland, and now is one of the few still on-going microbreweries in Finland established in the 1990s.\r\n\r\nTeerenpeli Brerwery & Distillery executes brewing and distilling with ambition and efficiency. In product manufacture the emphasis is on quality raw materials, clear tasting experiences and in theimprovement of Finnish drinking culture. Teerenpeli Brewery & Distillery makes first-rare, fine quality and tasty beverages for restaurant and bar sales and for retail. Product manufacture is powered with renewable energy from their own wood pellet power plant. \r\n\r\nTeerenpeli Distillery is one of the oldest distilleries in the Nordics and crrently a clear market leader in Finnish Single Malt Whiskies in Finland. \r\n\r\nThe larger main Teerenpeli Distillery is located with the brewery outside Lahti city centre. At this main Teerenpeli Distillery there is also a Visitor Centre with guided tours to the ditstillery and brewery.",
