    "description": "Behind the Chanel brand – its glamour, its muses, and the worldwide success of the maison – lies a mystery: Gabrielle “Coco” Chanel. An elusive woman who constantly reinvented her life as she designed her dresses—adding, removing, transforming. Who is this secretive figure at the helm of the greatest empire ever built by a woman? What secrets lie behind this ultimate fashion icon?",
    "tourProgramExample": "How Gabrielle Became “Coco Chanel”: the unstoppable rise of a woman with humble origins\r\nThe Chanel Revolution and its impact on the lives of women of her time and today’s\r\nIconic Locations of the Chanel Universe in Paris: Rue Cambon, Ritz Hotel, Place Vendôme\r\nAn Extraordinary Character: bold, straightforward, often provocative—Mademoiselle Chanel herself!\r\nChanel’s Legacy Today: a brand that continues to fascinate and inspire the world\r\n\r\nThis street tour will guide you, through emblematic streets of Opera, Madeleine & Concorde historical neighborhoods and (amongst others) through and by :\r\nRue Cambon 21 & 31\r\nPlace Vendôme & The Ritz\r\nTuileries gardens",
