    "streetAddress": "23 Rue de Sévigné, 75003 Paris, France",
    "openingHours": "The museum is open from 10.00 to 18.00 from Tuesday to Sunday\r\n\r\nThe ticket office closes at 17.15 Last entry 17.15 (permanent collection and temporary exhibition)\r\n\r\nThe exhibition rooms close at 17.45\r\n\r\nThe exhibition rooms close at 17.00 on December 24 and 31\r\n\r\nPublic holidays: the museum is closed on 1 January, 1 May and 25 December\r\n\r\nOutside opening hours, it is possible to organize private visits to the permanent collections and temporary exhibitions in groups or simply for a stroll. Several tour themes are offered.",
