    "description": "The mission of L’ÉCOLE, School of Jewellery Arts is to share the culture of jewellery with a large and varied audience, both in France and abroad. By offering hands-on à la carte classes taught by passionate experts, videos and books, talks and exhibitions, L’ÉCOLE welcomes the public to learn about the savoir faire of jewellery-making techniques, the world of precious stones, and the history of jewellery.\r\n\r\nL’ÉCOLE was established in 2012 with the support of Van Cleef & Arpels.\r\n\r\nBased in Paris and Hong Kong, L’ÉCOLE alsotravelsacross the worldduring its nomadic sessions.",
    "tourProgramExample": "1. SAVOIR-FAIRE\r\nDiscover and experience the richness\r\nof jewelry savoir-faire, from Japanese\r\nlacquer to the wax project and setting\r\ntechniques.\r\n***\r\nCourses of 2, 3 and 4 hours\r\nFrom 6 to 16 people maximum depending on\r\nthe course\r\n\r\n2. WINE & GEMS\r\nAn Oenologist & a Gemmologist will guide you in\r\na comparative discovery of wines and\r\ngemstones.\r\n*** \r\nWorkshop of 3 hours\r\nUp to 12 people \r\nExclusively in privatization\r\n\r\n3. CREATIVE WORKSHOPS\r\nfor children and teenagers\r\nOur offer consists of 4 workshops for children \r\nand 2 workshops for teenagers, for 8 to 16\r\nparticipants maximum depending on the\r\nworkshop.\r\nParents can participate in the workshops.",
