    "description": "It's magical to take a catamaran out for a day and/or evening of sailing! \r\n\r\nYour certified Merchant Navy crew will welcome you aboard a spacious and comfortable maxi-catamaran. \r\n\r\nWe cast off and hoist the mainsail... If you wish, you can take an active part in the manoeuvres and navigation (introduction to sailing)... \r\n\r\nWe drop anchor in a pretty cove for a swim and a real moment of conviviality at sea (music, dancefloor and bar on board)... Lunch or dinner served on board (menus on request).",
