    "description": "Immerse yourself in the world of Domaine GUETH, where Muriel, an independent winemaker, invites you to enjoy a friendly, fun and gourmet wine-tourism experience, marked by her delicate feminine touch.\r\n\r\nDuring this visit, you’ll have the chance to go behind the scenes of the estate and discover the winemaking, storage and packaging facilities. You’ll learn all about Muriel’s unique philosophy and feminine approach to wine, and her organic, no-holds-barred method, the details of which will be revealed on the spot!\r\n\r\nAfter this fascinating immersion, you’ll be invited to a commented tasting of 6 local wines, enhanced by 6 gourmet bites. This sensory experience will allow you to harmoniously combine the discovery of our naturally produced organic Alsace wines with the pleasure of a gastronomic break featuring bread, charcuterie and quality cheeses.\r\n\r\nTo crown this experience in a surprising way, a 7th surprise wine will be offered: let yourself be surprised by an unexpected final touch that will make your visit to Domaine GUETH even more memorable.",
