    "description": "Dare to Wine with a Feminine Touch is an exciting oenotouristic adventure through the vineyards and wine. Muriel, an independent winegrower, opens the doors of her wine universe to you for a two-hour immersive experience.\r\n\r\nLet yourself be guided and first discover organic viticulture during an unusual walk through the vineyards. Between passion and respect for the earth, you will discover the know-how of the house through a family and feminine philosophy.\r\n\r\nThe 8-hectare Domaine GUETH estate houses its cellars in the heart of the vineyard. During this immersive and human adventure, you will visit the technical equipment used to make the cuvées, which Muriel will explain to you before revealing some of her secrets.\r\n\r\nThe experience ends with a comparative and commented tasting of 6 to 8 organic Alsatian wines, selected according to your tastes and desires. Each cuvée has its own story, which Muriel will tell you with passion. Enjoy this wine tasting with a pretzel or a piece of Gugelhupf with a few crackers.",
