    "description": "Visit the oldest art glass factory in Europe!\r\nSince 1475, La Rochère has perpetuated a unique heritage, shaped by generations of master glassmakers and glassblowers. 550 years of history is a journey through time, where tradition and innovation have always been able to meet to give birth to exceptional creations.\r\n\r\nFounded in the midst of the Renaissance, La Rochère has survived the centuries preserving the authenticity of its craftsmanship while integrating modern technologies and daring collaborations\r\nwith renowned designers. Even today, our workshops continue to transform glass into everyday objects and exceptional pieces, bearers of stories and joys in everyday life, witnesses of a living and constantly evolving heritage.",
