    "description": "Since 1973, we have been proud to share our passion for wine through the Maison du Muscadet.\r\n\r\nLocated in Vallet, the capital of Muscadet in the heart of the Nantes vineyards. We are 21 passionate winegrowers who present our most beautiful vintages.\r\n\r\nOur commitment to the Muscadet Sèvre et Maine appellations, as well as the Crus Goulaine, Mouzillon-Tillières and Vallet, allows us to offer you a range of varied wines from Cru 2020 to Cru 2012.\r\n\r\nThis also includes red, white (Chardonnay, Sauvignon), rosé, sparkling wines and dessert wines, Pinot Gris, also produced on our estates.\r\n\r\nWe also offer white or rosé grape juices without alcohol, additives and added sugar, sparkling or still.\r\n\r\nWe firmly believe that each bottle tells a story, and we strive to introduce the richness and diversity of the terroirs of our region to all our customers.",
