    "city": "Chamonix-Mont-Blanc",
    "streetAddress": "35 Rte du Golf, 74400 Chamonix-Mont-Blanc",
    "openingHours": "Season & Maintenance \r\nSeason: Generally runs from late April to late November, depending on snowfall. \r\nCompetitions: \r\nHeld mostly on weekends. \r\nFew competitions are scheduled in July and August to prioritize external players. \r\n\r\nGreens Maintenance: \r\n\r\nMid-May: Major aeration and organic material removal. \r\n\r\nEarly September: Light perforation. \r\nRecovery time: 7-10 days to restore excellent playing quality.",
