    "tags": [
      "Food",
      "Culture"
    ],
    "description": "From street food to Michelin star with GoArt! – Discover new cooking styles and restaurant concepts that continue to conquer Berlin.\r\n\r\nStartups, co-working spaces, pop up kitchens and award-winning chefs, street food and haute cuisine, urban gardening and sustainable design: all these symbolically stand for Berlin’s food and lifestyle scene.\r\n\r\nDive into the world of the gourmets where creative thinking, exceptional developments and unique taste pallets know no borders and attract food enthusiasts from all over the world.",
    "tourProgramExample": "*Berlin’s Thrilling New Food Concepts*\r\nOn a private walking tour we combine Kiezkultur with exquisite food spots – this way you are able to enjoy delicacies while incidentally discovering urban developments and local aspects of the city since the Fall of the Berlin Wall. You will be surrounded by high quality from the production to the preparation phase: Raw food, vegan cooking, local and seasonal Green Treats – get to know extravagant restaurants and store concepts with GoArt!\r\n\r\n*Berlin Hotspots – The Best Of: Kantstraße*\r\nNo matter which Kiez you want to discover, GoArt! shows you Berlin’s most popular and trendy food spots: for example the busy Kantstraße in Charlottenburg. Enjoy all kinds of Asian goodies from fish delicacies to exclusive fine dining experiences. Fans of traditional home cooking get their money’s worth in long-established West-Berlin institutions and artists’ pubs. Whether it is selected wines, delicate pastries or exquisite cocktail creations – enjoy culinary delights at the highest level with us. Together we will end the day in a relaxing atmosphere with a glass of wine around beautiful Savignyplatz or enjoy some live jazz at one of the renowned bars in Charlottenburg.",
