    "description": "Fashion + Lifestyle Tours in Berlin: ‘Fashion made in Berlin’ is bound to set new international trends. The creative fashion and lifestyle scene is growing continuously. From street wear to up cycling and Haute Couture – more than 800 labels have settled in the capital. We will give you insight into Berlin’s fashion scene as well as sustainable product-, interior- and furniture design.\r\n\r\nTwice a year the city is home to the Fashion Week and a multitude of fashion shows attract international shoppers, journalists and fashion enthusiasts from all over the world. On view – also at DMY Berlin – is a wide range of labels: up and coming designers as well as established brands. We offer small private presentations of collections and design talks, showroom visits as well as fashion-drawing teambuilding events.",
    "tourProgramExample": "*The City’s Fashion Talents*\r\nDiscover private showrooms and exclusive boutiques. Together we will stroll to petite, exquisite locations in Berlin Mitte, Charlottenburg, Kreuzberg or Neukölln.\r\n\r\n*Private Shopping for Trendsetters*\r\nEven more extravagant is a privately booked personal talk with designers while enjoying a glass of champagne at an aspiring fashion label. Besides, upon request we realize small fashion shows. Of course you always have the chance to shop in an exclusive and intimate atmosphere off-mainstream.\r\n\r\n*Sustainability in Berlin*\r\nVisit the fashion newcomers in Berlin Mitte and Kreuzberg, visionaries, designers, architects and urban gardening projects, which focus on sustainability and all its aspects in their productions.",
