    "description": "Starting from its foundation in 1826, Herend Porcelan was always a unique manufactory that lived through several ownership changes and financial difficulties in the past 200 years. Despite all the alteration and the ups and downs, it never lost its own art style, always managed to smuggle its own designs into the varied decorations when the goal was to replenish Chinese porcelain supplies of aristocrats. And also, always stayed true to itself when it came to awe the public in different world exhibitions.\r\n\r\nAnd nowadays, it is safe to say it was not a work of chance that Herend got so big, it is exporting to more than 50 countries. Today there are a thousand employees who preserve the tradition once was started only by 54.​\r\n\r\nBe part of the great culture of porcelain making at Herend during one of its own creative workshops.",
