    "description": "Don't miss Europe's largest immersive performance!\r\n\r\nAn experience you've never had before is coming. In the fall of 2025, a unique immersive attraction will open in Budapest. In the six thousand square meters of magical world of Walk My World, reminiscent of movie sets, there are impressively rich spaces waiting to be discovered and gods, mortals and strange creatures from myths surround the audience to discover an experience never experienced before.\r\n\r\nThe boundaries of the theater disappear. There is no auditorium... No stage... just you and the magic of movement.\r\n\r\nWalk My World is an immersive production where the audience enters the reality of the performers as an invisible observer - as if they were dropped into a movie. The audience can move freely in the space dominated by mythical creatures and gods, where every detail - the characters, the props, the storylines - is waiting to be discovered.\r\n\r\nThe plot unfolds in several strands, and each visitor can piece together the story in their own way, which takes place in the mythical world of Troy and Carthage and brings to life the love tragedy of Aeneas and Dido based on Virgil's epic.\r\n\r\nWalk My World is a theater, exhibition, role-playing game and adventure novel in its own right. An innovative, captivating, cultural-entertainment experience in every way.\r\n\r\nEnter a magical world full of secrets, where gods and their creatures await!\r\n\r\nWhen you arrive at the Great Hall, tune in to the special experience at the Walk My World bar. Enjoy a drink, listen to live music and pay attention to every detail, because the mysterious story begins here.",
