    "description": "A new way to travel to Italy!!!\r\n\r\nReturn trips to Italy and Tourism of the roots with organization of tours, guided excursions and dedicated events to discover own family origins and places lived by own ancestors.\r\n\r\nWith this type of travel a person/family can live an exciting experience that brings back in time to roots and places of one's family of origin, to know the history of the ancestors, the traditions, the cuisine of own land birthplace and perhaps meet living relatives.\r\n\r\nADDITIONAL SERVICES:\r\n- Genealogical research with assistance before and during the trip\r\n- Memory Book, a valuable work which is put together at the end of this emotional trip, including the documents of the research, some information about the hometown and the way of life of the ancestors         \r\n- English staff available",
    "tourProgramExample": "GROUP TOURS:\r\nDesigned for those who belong to the same geographical area of origin, this is an organized group tour combining also the flexibility to participate in independent 1-day visits to the hometown of own family of origin.\r\n\r\n​​​​​​​INDIVIDUAL TOURS:\r\nFully taylor made, with itineraries created by combining places related to the results of genealogical research and the most attractive spots in Italy for cultural relevance and scenic beauty.",
