    "description": "Street food experience in Rome in Campo de Fiori square and tasting desserts near Pantheon and Rome downtown in 2 hours.",
    "tourProgramExample": "1. Campo de Fiori square.​ \r\n2 hours duration including local fruits market visit and tasting of local products with chef followed by lunch in a private loft in Trastevere.​\r\nDuring street food experience in Campo​ De Fiori square we will include tasting of the famous Pizza by bakery “Roscioli “​\r\n\r\n2. Take away Ice cream or Tiramisu in the city centre​\r\nTasting of one of the best ice creams in Rome “Venchi”.​ Shops are located near the Spanish steps or in Pantheon area.​\r\nOR​\r\nTasting of the typical tiramisu dessert by Pompi, near the Spanish steps.​\r\n\r\n3. Tasting ‘’granita di caffe’ con panna’’\r\nTasting of one of the best “granita di caffe’ con panna “ in Rome at Tazza D’oro .​\r\nShop of Tazza D’oro is located near Pantheon.​\r\nYou can enjoy granita during sightseeing or free time.​\r\n​",
