    "description": "Horseback riding or carriage riding on the hills of the Valdichiana Senese.\r\n\r\nA horseback riding to slowly explore, in the open air, the most beautiful and panoramic places of the Valdichiana.\r\n\r\nAn expert guide will accompany you through the paths, along the vineyards and fields. At the end of the walk, you will visit a winery, where qualified personnel will welcome you and explain all the secrets of the Vino Nobile di Montepulciano, from the vineyard to the bottle. You will also have a light lunch in the winery with typical products and a glass of Rosso di Montepulciano DOC and a glass of Vino Nobile di Montepulciano DOCG. \r\n\r\nAt the end of the light lunch a private car will take you back to the starting point. Would you like to surprise your partner? Instead of horseback riding, you can choose a carriage tour! The same path and services, but you will be lulled by the carriage. Write us and we will be able to organize the best romantic experience!\r\n\r\nThe tour includes:\r\n- Horseback riding with a guide (or carriage riding)\r\n- Visit of a winery and its vineyards\r\n- Tasting of 1 glass of Vino Nobile di Montepulciano DOCG\r\n- Tasting of 1 glass of Rosso di Montepulciano DOC\r\n- Transfer from the winery to the farm",
