    "description": "Explore Rome by bike and savor the best street food the Eternal City has  to offer!\r\n\r\nThe riding experience starts in Testaccio, with a delicious Italian breakfast in a historic venue of the district; then, pedaling along the beds of the river Tiber,  you will reach the breathtaking Piazza Venezia and Teatro Marcello and walk  across the ancient racetrack of Circo Massimo.\r\n\r\nAfter a gastronomic break in a traditional restaurant nestled in the wonderful  setting of the Jewish Quarter, you will continue your discovery by getting to the  vibrant Trastevere, a district steeped in history and a sought-after destination.\r\n\r\nFor street food lovers; here, you will enjoy a well-deserved moment of relax and  conviviality, paired by yummy bites and a toast to the team!\r\n\r\nAn experience to share with your colleagues that allows you to strengthen your bonds and build constructive relationships outside the working environment!",
