    "description": "The Pasta Making Class is the ideal lesson for those who want to learn the art of fresh handmade pasta and discover the secrets of the tradition of Italian master \r\npasta makers! \r\n\r\nAfter warming up the atmosphere with a welcome aperitif, the apron is tied on and the experience begins: our chef will follow the group step by step in the creation of a perfect dough, entertaining them with anecdotes and \r\ncuriosities about the Italian culinary tradition.\r\n\r\nThe ingredients are worked by hand and the dough is rolled out, to then arrive at the final moment of cutting the fettuccine. They will have a rough texture and an \r\nexquisite taste just like those made by grandma! \r\n\r\nThe freshly produced pasta is cooked and the sauce is added by the chef. \r\nThe guests, comfortably seated in the cozy restaurant room, will taste the exquisite fruit of their work, with a paired drink!",
