    "description": "The Etna Volcano is famous all over the world for its evocative landscapes of rare beauty but it is also the homeland of good Sicilian wine and the headquarters of numerous symbolic companies of the area. \r\n\r\nDuring our Etna Wine tour, in the company of our expert guides you will be able to explore in total safety all the wonders that this magnificent area has to offer.\r\n\r\nCraters, volcanic caves, lava flows and the evocative lunar landscape will frame an unforgettable excursion, enriched by visits to symbolic companies of the place, where experience, passion and deep knowledge of the area and its traditions come together to give life to some of the best Sicilian wine excellences. \r\n\r\nWe will reach a famous winery for a tasting of the best Etna wines produced with millenary practices at the slopes of the Volcano, learning to grasp their aromas, colours and nuances: the ideal conclusion of this journey to discover the treasures of Sicily!",
