    "description": "Enjoy an unforgettable experience to discover the unique landscapes of the highest active volcano in Europe, embellished by the play of lights and colors of the sunset.\r\n\r\nWe will begin our excursion in the afternoon in the company of ourexpert environmental guides who will lead you, in complete safety, along a path full of beauty, three craters, lava caves and breathtaking views. \r\n\r\nYou will listen to stories about the origin and evolution of the volcano and curiosities on the fauna and flora that characterise it.\r\n\r\nWe will conclude the excursion at sunset; we will stop at a panoramic point to look at the horizon and the immense panorama, waiting for the splendid show. \r\n\r\nImmersed in a unique scenario in the world, we will sip excellent Etna wine produced right on the slopes of the volcano, accompanied by some snacks and wait for the sky to be tinged with wonderful colours!",
