    "description": "A food and wine journey through the streets of authentic Rome, to discover the stories, secrets and flavors of the Eternal City. \r\n\r\nOne of our local food experts will guide the guests on this gastronomic journey to discover authentic flavours, away from the tourist places: one of the best ways to discover the hidden gems of the city!\r\n\r\nWhile walking immersed in the magical atmosphere of the streets of the historic center, among the beauties of the ancient Jewish Ghetto, the Pantheon and the most famous and characteristic market in the city, they will taste a selection of delicacies that symbolize Roman cuisine, prepared according to ancient traditional recipes.\r\n\r\nThe experience begins with the famous Giudìa artichoke in the fascinating setting of the Jewish quarter, followed by a tasting of some of the locals’ favorite treats and fried foods: cheeses, local delicacies, supplì, Roman pizza, delicious panini and ends on a sweet note with one of the best gelato in Rome!",
