    "description": "See more of Rome's key sights in less time, and travel in comfort, on this private exclusive gourmet night experience. Enjoy a panoramic tour of Rome during the night seeing multiple famous and beautiful sights. \r\n\r\nMeet the owners of the restaurant, you are greeted with asmile and a handshake as if you were in the living room of their home. True lovers of Italian cuisine as well as new vineyards, small producer of cheeses and products out of the large distribution channels.\r\n\r\nOnly real connoisseurs know this wonderful family-run restaurant which is surprising for what it offers: delicious food, more than friendly staff, elegance and a cellar of respect, but also secret passages in the history of Rome.\r\n\r\nFrom the aperitif to the dessert in Italian style, be ready for a trip through senses discovering differences and highlights of food and wines of Italy.\r\n\r\nEnglish, Italian, French, Spanish, German\r\navailable on request\r\nVegetarian options available",
    "tourProgramExample": "Meet your english speaking driver at your hotel.\r\nTraveling in a black cab, you’ll see several spots of Rome at\r\nsunset such as Santa Maria Maggiore, St Peter's Basilica, and\r\nGianicolo hill to Sant'Angelo Castle and Trastevere, plus many more key landmarks.\r\nAfter a 1.5 hrs panoramic tour, you'll reach the restaurant for\r\nyour gourmet experience.\r\nYour personal foodie will guide you to discover a very special place where to taste amazing food and wine.\r\nMeet the owners of the restaurant\r\n\r\nEnjoy your aperitif and the four course tating menu with wine pairing. Start to taste some of the specialties of the house and learn about the history and the tradition.",
