    "description": "Expert or dummies, welcome to the world of the Italian\r\nexcellence product: extra virgin olive oil and wine!\r\nLive a relaxing and engaging tasting class, in a magnificent location in Rome City Centre.\r\n\r\nHave you ever realized that Italy offers more than 600\r\noriginal varieties of olives and grape varieties?\r\n\r\nThis wine and evo oil tasting will introduce you to the\r\nMediterranean cooking essential of olive oil, to Italian\r\nwinemaking and food pairing.\r\n\r\nDo you know to distinguish quality EVO from others?\r\n\r\nDiscover a world of local, quality producers whilst learning the various nutritive properties of olive oil. You will discuss with your hosts the history of olive oil, as well as the different varieties. You are sure to walk away from this tour with a profound new knowledge of olive oil that you can share and show off to your friends at dinner parties back home!\r\n\r\nItaly is wine and food, no doubt. That is why it is important to understand quality. Let's tate together 4 wines from different regions. Learning how to pair those ith food, for the most amazing game ever.\r\n\r\nYou will love the location for this experience! an amazing\r\ngrocery store where to buy all the foods you like at the end of the experience.\r\n\r\nNot only, this is a renoewd wine bar that serves amazing\r\nrecipes. Are you in?\r\n\r\nThis experience is suitable for vegetarians and vegan people(when priorly advised).\r\n\r\nFoodie Guide available in English",
