    "description": "The mountains around Cernobbio are full of history. For sure, you do not expect\r\nto find the border with Swiss in the middle of the nature!!\r\nThis is the goal with this hike. Starting from a district of Cernobbio we will follow\r\nvery old paths full of history and breathtaking views.\r\nStep by step you will get the possibility to touch the Swiss territory.\r\nThe route even if at times challenging will be made compelling and interesting by\r\nthe stories of the guide who will illustrate the nature, and the places crossed.\r\nAt the end of the trail, you will find the house of an 84 years old wood sculptor\r\nwho will tell you about the history of his family and all the “adventures” his\r\nparents and grand-parents lived during the War. An emotional momnt not to be\r\nmissed that will indeed enrich your experience and life.",
