    "description": "As the summer winds down, Trentino becomes an apple lover's paradise. Tractors rumble through the streets, transporting crates of freshly harvested apples from orchards to processing facilities. People flock to the region to assist with the apple harvest, savor the fruits of their labor, or simply enjoy a freshly picked apple right from the tree. Between September and October, apples are abundant throughout Trentino, particularly in Val di Sole.\r\nWhat’s included:\r\n• a tour of the farm, with a stroll in the orchard as the farmer\r\ndescribes his work to you\r\n• a first-hand experience of harvesting apples.\r\n• a box of apples that you can take home with you\r\n• snack with products made from apples",
