    "description": "Nerdi Workshop is an authentic artisan's shop inside the Casa dell'Orafo on the Ponte Vecchio.\r\n\r\nHere, where the convent of the church of Santo Stefano al Ponte once stood, time seems to have stood still. Gold and silver are melted, worked, pierced, and engraved using ancient techniques that are renewed daily, rich in tradition and experience.\r\n\r\nCreations and restorations are joined by custom commissioned jewellery.\r\n\r\nStarting from a design, the process leads to a personalized creation where attention to detail, combined with the client's taste and the artisan's creativity, gives life to extraordinary craftsmanship.\r\n\r\nYou'll have the unique opportunity to hear their story, view their creations and watch them while creating masterpieces.",
