    "description": "Inserrata is a family-run winery in San Miniato specialized in organic farming since 1997.\r\nCommitted to environmental protection and biodiversity, the winery crafts exceptional wines and organic extra virgin olive oil from its hand-selected grapes and olives.\r\nBeyond its agricultural pursuits, Inserrata is a hub for the arts. It collaborates with European artists and hosts exhibitions, blending winemaking with art and design. This passion is also reflected in its bottles, which are true\r\nmasterpieces designed by artist Alexandria Coe.\r\n\r\nEnjoy a private 3 to 5 wines tasting experience to savour Inserrata's organic wines and olive oil. Accompanied by local delicacies like sausages, cheeses, honey, and focaccia, the tasting is an opportunity to explore the flavours of Tuscany and learn about the region's culture.\r\nYou can also request a guided tour of the cellar, vineyards, and olive groves to complete the experience.",
