    "tourProgramExample": "You can choose your own guide for the palace tour: standard guide or costumed guide with theatrical program.\r\nCharm of Gallant Century is a special theatrical program in Rundale Palace  (1 hour and 30 minutes)\r\n\r\nCostumed guides will show you the Palace and you will see their menuet dance during the tour. You will also discover the intriguing story of E.J Biron and the Russian Empress Anna Ivanova during the visit of the Dukes former apartments and guides will share the most sacred secrets of the witty and playful, sensitive and sophisticated court life of the 18th century.",
