    "description": "Newly opened Kotor cable car is located in an attractive area, near major coastal routes, with the Lower Station Dub just 200 meters from the Budva - Tivat road and a mere 5 kilometers from Tivat Airport. Before the ride, you can indulge in additional amenities at the Lower Station Dub. \r\n          \r\nThe Kotor cable car ride offers a thrilling journey lasting 11 minutes, covering a distance of 3,900 meters. The cable car has a capacity of 1,200 passengers per hour, with 48 gondolas that can accommodate up to 10 people each, ensuring a smooth and hassle-free boarding process. You'll ascend from the starting point at Dub to the final station at Kuk, soaring 1,316 meters above sea level. \r\n\r\nAs you ascend, prepare to be captivated by the awe-inspiring views of the majestic Bay of Kotor. Before you embark, take a moment to discover why this bay is renowned as one of the world's most beautiful. Once onboard, you will be rewarded with a breathtaking view of the Bay of Kotor. So get ready for the \"ride of a lifetime.“",
