    "description": "Stretching for 20 miles between Haarlem and Leiden, the Flower Strip (called the Bollenstreek or Bulb District) is home to the world famous Dutch tulip fields. \r\n\r\nThe Tulip Experience provides a unique combination of a museum, show garden and indoor picking garden that is perfect for all tulip lovers. \r\n\r\nThe Pennings family has been passionately growing tulip bulbs for over 70 years and they are happy to share that knowledge with their visitors. \r\n\r\nIn the museum, visitors will learn all about the history and growing process of the tulip. \r\n\r\nIn the outdoor show garden, they will immerse themselves in a blooming sea of tulips (with 1 million tulips in 700 varieties!) \r\n\r\nAfterwards, visitors are able to pick a bunch of tulips in the indoor picking garden.",
    "tourProgramExample": "-Breakfast at hotel​\r\n-Head towards the flower region​\r\n-Visit to the Tulip Experience. ​\r\n\r\nlunch ​\r\n-Proceed towards the flower garden​\r\n-Visit Keukenhof Flower garden, the most famous and largest flower park in the world and lies not far from Amsterdam.​\r\n-Back to Amsterdam, for dinner​\r\n-dinner at a local restaurant ​\r\n-Back to hotel and overnight​",
