    "description": "The Mauritshuis is one of the world's most famous art museums. Take this unique opportunity to not only see some of the most priceless art pieces in the world but have an art class straight after! \r\n\r\nStart with a guided tour past a few of the highlights from the Mauritshuis collection, such as Vermeers Girl with the Pearl Earring, Still Life with Cheeses, Almonds and Pretzels by Clara Peeters and Rembrandts The Anatomy Lesson. \r\n\r\nAfter you have gained inspiration seeing their highlights, you will have a seat behind an easel in the Art Room for a painting workshop. \r\n\r\nWill you follow in the footsteps of Rembrandt, Vermeer or will you paint each other’s portrait?\r\n\r\nOr would you rather paint a food still life like Clara Peeters?",
