    "description": "WELCOME TO THE MOST SUSTAINABLE WHISKY IN THE WORLD\r\n\r\nWe are BUS Whisky, a dedicated team of sustainable whisky lovers with a mission: to make the most sustainable whisky in the world, in the Netherlands. Our craft distillery runs entirely on 100% renewable energy. We grow our own malting barley without artificial fertilizers and pesticides and prevent waste streams where possible through innovative innovations in the production process. With our barley from our own farm, we make beautiful whiskies, bottled in bottles made of 100% recycled glass.\r\n\r\nIn 2019, BUS Whisky proudly entered the Dutch whisky market as a fresh and daring brand. In a few years, we have grown from a modest Brabant start-up to the second largest whisky producer in the Netherlands.\r\n\r\nOur sustainable innovations in the production process of whisky are trendsetting in the whisky industry. \"BUS Whisky\" is named after the water source of the distillery. The Peelrandbreuk has been a natural formation of water sources in the East of Brabant for thousands of years. In the hamlet of Bus in Nistelrode, the water source of the whisky distillery is located on the farm where the malting barley for BUS Whisky is also grown.",
