    "description": "Eating while cruising through the canals, there is no experience more fitting to a visit to Amsterdam than this one. \r\n\r\nWhether you chose a private Indonesian Buffet cruise with Blue Boat, or join a scheduled 4 course dinner cruise with Lovers, every cruise is a feast for both your eyes and your tastebuds, with the UNESCO World Heritage listed canals outside the window and delicious food on the table in front of you.\r\n\r\nListen to the commentary on your audioguide, or add a live guide for your private cruise to complete the evening.\r\n\r\nDepending on the time of year you step on board, you may catch the last rays of sun and a sunset on board or experience the canals in the dark of night. \r\n\r\nBoth the golden hour and night time on the canals are magical. The evening sun gives a golden glow to the canals built in the Dutch Golden Age, while at night the canals twinkle in the darkness as they are lit up by thousands of lights.",
