    "tags": [],
    "description": "The fjords in Norway are world famous for their tranquil, unspoiled landscapes. Our half-day fjord cruise takes you from Bergen’s historic city center into the heart of the fjords. Make yourself comfortable and enjoy the view of famous Bryggen in Bergen as we depart from the city center. The farther into the fjords we get, the steeper and more spectacular the mountain landscape becomes. Our expert crew navigates safely through the Mostraumen straits, so narrow that boats can barely sail through.\r\n\r\nAlong the way, we pass numerous charming villages and waterfalls. Feel the refreshing mist as our crew brings the boat right up to one of them. With luck, we might even spot a sea eagle!",
