    "description": "Top Secret Dining is an interactive dining experience developed in collaboration with Gaustabanen.\r\n\r\nImagine you are attending an event where you are taken back in time – to the 1960s and the Cold War. At that time, Gaustatoppen played a central role in NATO's surveillance of our neighbour to the east.\r\n\r\nDo you dare to bring your management team, board or employees to this unique dinner experience 1883 meters above sea level? We promise it will be a \"talking point\" and an experience you will not soon forget!\r\n\r\nNot least because you get to meet the spy Ruth Bergslien. That's the lady! Tough and clear as few others.\r\n\r\nDo you want to meet Ruth, take part in Norwegian history and be strictly told to button up your jacket?",
