    "description": "Europes earliest dogsled adventure starts already October 20th! Join our huskies for a arctic dog sledding experience in the wilderness, surrounded by mountain and fjord.\r\n\r\nOn this tour you are driven by our dog musher – 2 people per sled. Our driver will pick you up at your hotel in Kirkenes, and take you on a 15 minute ride to the Snowhotel Kirkenes camp outside Kirkenes. Here you will be met by our dog musher by the reception.\r\n\r\nAfter dressing up, and meeting our huskies in our dogyard, we will go dogsledding. The tour is approximately 6 km and goes along the fjord and through classic arctic, lightly forested wilderness. We will make a short break on the way, to rest the dogs and share some stories.\r\n\r\nWhen we return to the Snowhotel camp, our driver will take you back to your hotel in Kirkenes.",
