    "description": "The wildest cab ever! Imagine stepping out of the plane, and instead of going to luggage claim, a team of strong and eager huskies are waiting for you, ready to take you across the arctic mountains, straight to the doorstep of the Snowhotel.\r\n\r\nAfter meeting with the husky team and the professional dog musher at the airport, you will be provided with a warm suit and boots and then will be ready to embark on your journey from the airport to the Snowhotel.\r\n\r\nOne sledge is shared between two people and driven by a professional musher. For bigger families and groups – husky teams as big as needed can be provided.\r\n\r\nWhilst you take the scenic route over the mountains, across tundra and along arctic fjords, your luggage will be transferred via car and will be waiting for you at the hotel.\r\n\r\nThis tour is available to book for all guests staying overnight in the Snowhotel or Gamme cabins with flights arriving between 11:00 and 15:00, from the Kirkenes Høybuktmoen airport to the hotel.\r\n\r\nNB! Only available for arrivals, nor for departures.",
