    "description": "Join our eager huskies for a peaceful trek in the mountains.\r\n\r\nThis tour includes transfer to/from Thon or Scandic hotel in Kirkenes – send us your choice.\r\n\r\nOur guide will pick you up at your hotel, and drive you to Snowhotel 365 camp in Sandnesdalen, 15 minutes from Kirkenes. You will meet our reindeer and our huskies, before you meet your husky companion that will join you on the mountain hike.\r\n\r\nWe will walk along the fjord, then up the path to the mountain. The slopes are not too steep or challenging. On the top we will make a fire by an WW2 airplane wreck, if the weather permits. Here we will take in the view, whilst enjoying some classic Norwegian hiking snacks and refreshments.\r\n\r\nThe guide will tell you about northern nature, huskies and any questions you may have. There will also of course be plenty of time to cuddle with the dogs. After the pitstop, we will continue the journey down to the Snowhotel camp, and our driver will take you back to Kirkenes.",
