    "description": "The captain sets the course for good fishing spots while sailing in spactacular surroundings. Bring yor own fishing rod, use one of ours, or join the trip just to enjoy the beautiful scenery and the old boat itself.\r\n\r\nOn this trip you get to feel both the excitement while fishing and the peace and quiet on board. Catch the big cod, take in the views, explore the beautiful boat and get to know the exciting Hermes II story. And have your camera ready; the nice photo spots are almost uncountable.\r\n\r\nHeated lounge below deck and warm suits for free use.\r\nCold beverage for sale. Hot drinks and fresh fish included.",
