    "description": "A dining experience:\r\nAfter a 300 meters walk to a traditional boathouse, you will pull live king crabs out of a saltwater aquarium. Get them cooked in front of you while you listen to stories of the king crabs' prevalence  as a natural resource and how they made their journey from  Kamchatka to Kirkenes.\r\n\r\nHighlights\r\n- Delight in freshly cooked king crab legs served with accompaniments\r\n- Travel past fjords in a van or bus guided by captivating storytelling\r\n- Arrive at Aera Panorama Glass Lodge after a scenic drive from Tromsø\r\n- Pull live king crabs from an aquarium and witness their preparation\r\n- Savor the crab's natural flavors, complemented by tea, coffee, or water",
