    "description": "Join us at Northern Lights Chase with Arctic Princess. Experience the magical northern lights outside on our daybed or lounge terrace at Arctic Princess.\r\n\r\nWe sail from Tromsø Center, Floating Jetty just minutes from the main street. While sailing/hunting, you can sit inside in our warm Panorama saloon while relaxing and looking at Tromsø Island from a Sea View.\r\n\r\nWe will use either Arctic Princess or our Arctic Charm, or both depending on how many guests booked. Max 10-12 on each.\r\n\r\nOur catamarans is a really nice and comfortable boat – they are designed for VIP and comfortable sailing and a perfect place to be while waiting for the magical Northern Lights.\r\n\r\nPlease note\r\n- In the early season from the end of August to mid-September, departure time is 22:00. Due to the light situation.\r\n- You will be notified, if we need to change the departure time.\r\n\r\n\r\nWhat's included\r\n- We serve our fish soup for lunch on the way back to Tromsø.\r\n- We have warm thermal suits for all guests on board and fishing gear.",
