    "description": "One of our experienced staff members will guide you through the process of manufacturing various types of spirits, such as vodka, aquavit, gin and whisky at the world’s northernmost distillery.\r\n\r\nYou’ll get a glimpse into the mysterious past of Viking age drinking customs, making moonshine in Northern Norway, and learn about hi-tech alcohol production on top of the world.\r\n\r\nPart of this tour takes place outside (walking between buildings) and spending time in cold warehouses. We recommend to bring adequate clothing for this.\r\nDuring this exciting guided tour, you will see, feel and smell Arctic ingredients. The tour includes 3 tastings.",
