    "description": "Experience the magic of Arctic evenings on this serene fjord cruise just outside Tromsø. As daylight stretches into midnight, glide across quiet waters aboard a purpose-built vessel—nearly half powered by electric propulsion—for an eco-friendly, scenic journey.\r\n\r\nAccompanied by expert English-speaking guides, you’ll learn about the midnight sun, the region’s natural history, and the subtle shifts of Arctic light. Keep your eyes peeled for seabirds, including puffins during summer months, and panoramic views of coastal communities and mountain silhouettes.\r\n\r\nThe ship features a cozy indoor salon, onboard restrooms, free Wi-Fi, and a café for refreshments. Tours depart from Kaigata 6 (next to Skarven Kro) — plan to arrive 15 minutes early.\r\n\r\nHighlights:\r\n- Chase the glow of the setting sun across fjords\r\n- Learn from passionate Arctic guides\r\n- Great photo opportunities in soft evening light\r\n- Wildlife sightings (e.g. puffins)\r\n- Eco-conscious vessel with electric propulsion\r\n\r\nNotes:\r\n- Group sizes: 8 to 100 pax\r\n\r\nCancellation: full refund if canceled 48+ hours in advance\r\n\r\nReduced mobility? Contact them in advance to request assistance\r\n\r\nSet sail for an unforgettable evening of light, silence, and Arctic beauty.",
