    "description": "ABOUT ACTIVITY\r\nStep into a magical Arctic landscape \r\nand experience the beauty of winter \r\nup close! Join us for Snowshoeing \r\nin the Arctic, an unforgettable \r\nadventure along Narvik’s breathtaking \r\nmountainsides. Wander through serene \r\nmountain sides and untouched snow, \r\nwhile the crisp air and quiet beauty of \r\nthe Arctic wilderness envelop you.\r\nNo experience needed – if you can \r\nwalk, you can snowshoe! Our modern \r\nsnowshoes are easy to use and \r\ndesigned for all skill levels, making this \r\nactivity perfect for families, couples, \r\nand solo explorers alike.\r\nWarm up at our cozy Camp Lodge after \r\nthe adventure, where you’ll be served \r\nhot soup, freshly baked bread, and a \r\nsteaming cup of coffee or cocoa. Share \r\nstories by the fire and enjoy the tranquil \r\natmosphere of this Arctic hideaway. \r\nAre you ready to explore the Arctic in \r\na fun and accessible way? Book your \r\nsnowshoeing adventure today and \r\ndiscover the magic of Narvik’s winter \r\nlandscapes.\r\nINCLUDED\r\n• Snowshoe rental \r\n• Instructor \r\n• Soup and coffee/cocoa.\r\nGOOD TO KNOW\r\n• Participant age from 10 years\r\n• Book latest 24 hrs before the activity \r\nstarts\r\n• Clothing according to weather conditions",
