    "description": "ABOUT ACTIVITY\r\nJoin us in the wilderness and let \r\nlightning-fast paws guide you through \r\nmystical landscapes. Travel across \r\ndiverse terrains; woods, rivers, valleys, \r\nand hills, through a breathtaking \r\nenvironment that will leave you in awe. \r\nUnwind and immerse ourselves in the \r\nmysteries of Sami culture after the trip. \r\nEnjoy traditional Sami food, listen to \r\nstories from Sápmi, and take part in \r\nancient Sami ceremonies. \r\nAccording to Sami tradition, the souls \r\nof our ancestors live in the Northern \r\nLights, so a special ceremony is held \r\nto invite them to reveal themselves. \r\nA sacred drink is served, and the \r\nceremony ends with biidus, a traditional \r\nSami meal, along with coffee and cakes, \r\nvegetarian options are also available.\r\nThis is a once-in-a-lifetime experience. \r\nIn Sami tradition, we respect the \r\nNorthern Lights as the souls of our \r\nforefathers dancing in the sky. Now, you \r\nhave the chance to meet them.\r\nINCLUDED\r\n• Experienced guide \r\n• Preparing and cuddling with the \r\nhuskies for the tour\r\n• Dog sledding tour\r\n• Bidos served in heated lavvu and \r\ncoffee and cake\r\n• Sami-northern lights ceremony with \r\nstorytelling about sami culture and joik \r\nand a serving of chaga tea\r\nGOOD TO KNOW\r\n• Bring warm winter clothes, boots, hats \r\nand mittens",
