    "description": "ABOUT ACTIVITY\r\nImagine the distant sound of rushing \r\nwater from an underground river, the \r\ncool scent of damp earth and stone \r\nfilling the air. These are the whispers \r\nof Sagelva’s caves, a labyrinth carved \r\nover millennia by the relentless power \r\nof water. With expert guides leading \r\nthe way, you’ll navigate narrow paths, \r\nrocky terrain, and fascinating crevices, \r\neach step drawing you deeper into the \r\nwonders of the underground.\r\nYour expedition culminates in the \r\ndiscovery of a secret underground \r\nwaterfall; a breathtaking sight that \r\nrewards your journey through this \r\nnatural marvel. The guides, seasoned \r\nin both exploration and safety, ensure \r\nevery participant can focus on the aweinspiring beauty around them, making \r\nthis adventure as secure as it is exiting.\r\nWhile the underground paths offer \r\na thrilling challenge, above ground \r\nyou’ll find a welcoming atmosphere \r\nwith snacks and drinks to refresh and \r\nrecharge. It’s an ideal opportunity \r\nto bond as a family while immersing \r\nyourselves in the wonders of Salangen’s \r\nnatural world. \r\nINCLUDED\r\n• Guided Caving\r\n• Snack and a drink\r\n• Helmet and headlamp\r\nGOOD TO KNOW\r\n• Bring durable clothes and good \r\nshoes\r\n• Children as young as three years old \r\ncan join in the fun, provided they’re \r\naccompanied by a parent.",
