    "description": "During the summer months, the midnight sun gives you many extra hours to enjoy your day. What better way to spend a sunny evening, than having dinner on a boat? Join us for a unique culinary experience out on the fjords of Svalbard.\r\nBetween April and August, Svalbard is immersed in sunlight around the clock. The sun shines bright both during day and night, which is a very odd feeling! On this evening tour, we sail out on Isfjorden and cruise along the never-ending mountain landscapes. In addition to enjoying a delicious dinner in majestic surroundings, there are good chances that you will spot some wildlife. The fjords are normally full of sea birds, and with some luck we might spot a whale or two.\r\n\r\nYou will travel with the hybrid electric catamaran MS Bard. The engine and propellers are specially designed to minimise the noise and vibration. This not only takes you closer to nature; More importantly, the surrounding wildlife is less disturbed by our presence.\r\n\r\nDuring the cruise you will get served a three course dinner. The dinner is served inside, where you have a fantastic view through massive panoramic windows. Throughout the tour you are free to move on several outdoor decks as well, where you also can find comfortable seating areas.\r\n\r\nMenu\r\n\r\nBeetroot tartar with horseradish mayonnaise, toasted sunflower seeds and herbs\r\n\r\nBaked Svalbard cod with creamy fish sauce, roasted root vegetables and potato puree\r\n\r\nVanilla panna cotta with berries\r\n\r\nDrinks are available for purchase on board. We offer vegetarian options on request.",
    "tourProgramExample": "",
    "officialWebsite": "https://hurtigrutensvalbard.com/en/activities/boat/dinner-cruise-midnight-sun",
