    "description": "Historiske Avaldsnes invites you to step into the world of Viking kings and medieval Norway.\r\n\r\nSet in a landscape rich with royal history, you can explore ancient monuments, the medieval St. Olav’s Church, and immersive exhibitions that bring the stories of power, trade, and everyday life along the North Sea to life.\r\n\r\nIt’s a place where history, nature, and legend meet. During the summer season the guides are dressed up in traditional viking costumes to enhance the experience.",
