    "description": "The Lysefjord & Pulpit Rock cruise is a 3.5-hour scenic boat tour from Stavanger that takes you deep into Lysefjorden, one of Norway’s most spectacular fjords.\r\n\r\nYou’ll sail through towering cliffs and serene, dramatic landscapes, passing natural highlights like Vagabond’s Cave and the 75-meter “Whiskey” waterfall. The main highlight is Preikestolen (Pulpit Rock) — a massive flat rock plateau that rises about 604 meters above the fjord — seen from the water, providing an impressive and unique perspective. \r\n\r\nAlong the way, knowledgeable guides share stories about the fjord’s nature, geology and wildlife, and you can enjoy the views from outdoor decks or panoramic indoor saloons on Brim’s comfortable hybrid-electric vessel.",
