    "description": "Day trip. 3,5 - 4,5 hrs.\r\nThe tour go mostly far off the beaten track in varied terrain in the nearby untouched countryside. 27 - 45 km. The tour provide interesting dog sledding experiences. Hot drinks are served around a campfire in the wilderness. It is recommended to bring a sandwich or something else to toast by the fire.\r\n\r\nDrive your \"own\" dogteam together with a partner or a guide. A reasonable level of fitness, concentration and a sense of balance are the key attributes needed.  Alternative, sit warmly wrapped on dogsled as a passenger. Should be agreed in advance because it is depending on capacity.\r\n\r\nNOK 2.900,-\r\n\r\nDog sled ride 1 hr.\r\nYou will share a dog team with a partner or the guide. Alternative sit warmly wrapped on dogsled as a passenger.\r\n(Children < 10 year, 50 % discount)\r\nMin. 2 pers.\r\nNOK 1.900,-\r\n\r\nDog sled ride 1 hr. (Total 2 hr) incl. hot drinks and guided tour at Engholm Husky design lodge before/after the tour.\r\nYou will share a dog team with a partner or the guide. Alternative sit warmly wrapped on dogsled as a passenger.\r\n(Children < 10 year, 50 % discount)\r\nMin 4 pers.\r\nNOK 2.300,-",
