    "description": "Just minutes away from Honningsvåg — Bruket offers an iconic and interactive introduction to Norway’s wild fish industry. The history, its people, and its importance for a sustainable future.\r\n\r\nFish has always been a part of life here at North Cape: it kept our community alive through hardship and poverty, and today it continues to feed millions around the world. Managed properly, it remains a resource that can last for generations.\r\n\r\nInspired by our resilient ancestry, we now open our doors so you can step inside a working fish factory, meet the people behind the catch, and discover how the ocean sustains both our past and our future.\r\n\r\nEvery tour is led by our factory workers who share their own stories, and a tasting is always included.",
