    "description": "Experience an authentic Arctic evening adventure with a guided husky sled ride through the wilderness near Kirkenes. Travel quietly across snow-covered landscapes while professional mushers guide the sled, allowing you to simply enjoy the scenery. On clear nights, you may also glimpse the Northern Lights (weather permitting). This experience offers a peaceful yet thrilling introduction to traditional Arctic dog sledding.\r\n\r\nWhat you will experience:\r\n\r\nHotel pickup and transfer\r\n• 15-minute transfer to Snowhotel Kirkenes\r\n\r\nMeet the huskies\r\n• Introduction to the sled team and musher\r\n• Thermal clothing provided\r\n\r\nGuided dog sled ride\r\n• 2–3 guests per sled\r\n• Travel through the Arctic landscape\r\n• Photo stops and possible Northern Lights viewing\r\n\r\nAfter the ride\r\n• Warm drink before returning\r\n\r\nReturn transfer\r\n• Transfer back to your hotel in Kirkenes\r\n\r\nNote: In April, the tour runs as a scenic evening sled ride, but light conditions normally prevent Northern Lights sightings.\r\n\r\nLanguage: Tour conducted in English. Private tours in other languages are available on request.",
