    "description": "Easy-Going Guided Winter Sea Kayaking – Tromsø\r\n\r\nEnjoy a relaxed winter sea kayaking tour from Tromsø, paddling through calm Arctic fjords and island landscapes with a certified guide. After a short transfer to basecamp, guests receive drysuits, safety instructions, and basic paddling guidance before heading onto the water in stable kayaks. No previous kayaking experience is required.\r\n\r\nWhile kayaking in areas such as Kaldfjorden and Eidkjosen, you may spot Arctic wildlife including sea eagles, seals, otters, and seabirds. After the paddle, the group returns to basecamp to warm up by the fire with hot drinks and snacks before transferring back to Tromsø.\r\n\r\nDuration: approx. 4 hours (10:30–14:30) including transfer\r\nDeparture: Tromsø city centre\r\nMinimum age: 14 years\r\n\r\nIncluded: round-trip transfer, certified guide, kayak and paddle, drysuit, gloves and boots, hot drinks and biscuits.",
