    "description": "Along the historic quayside at Vervet, where Tromsø’s old shipyard once stood, you’ll find The HotSpot – a modern floating sauna facility inspired by the site’s maritime heritage. The design combines steel and wood with round portholes, creating a stylish expression that honors the city’s industrial history while inviting peace and well-being by the sea.\r\n\r\nThe facility has changing rooms, showers with clean (and cold) water, toilets, and a roof terrace with a great view of the Tromsø Strait. After a hot sauna session, you can take a refreshing sea bath before returning to the warmth.\r\n\r\nHere, warmth, sea and city life meet – a unique experience in the middle of Tromsø city center.",
