    "priceUnit": "",
    "country": "Poland",
    "city": "Walim",
    "streetAddress": "ul. 3 Maja 26, 58-320 Walim",
    "openingHours": "October-April:\r\nMonday to Friday: 09:00 – 17:00 (last entry at 16:00)\r\nSaturday, Sunday: 09:00 – 18:00 (last entry at 17:00)\r\n\r\nMay to September:\r\nMonday to Friday 09:00 – 18:00 (last entry at 17:00)\r\nSaturday, Sunday 09:00 – 19:00 (last entry at 18:00)\r\n\r\nThe complex is located on a borderline between the villages of Rzeczka and Walim. \r\nIt can be easily reached from Wroclaw (ca. 1 hour drive, 75 km).\r\n\r\nInside is a high level of humidity and the temperature stays approx +5°C throughout the year, so please bring some warm clothes. There is possibility to order an audioguide in English, German, Czech and French.\r\n\r\nClosed on Easter Sunday, 1 XI and 24-25 XII.",
