    "tourProgramExample": "11:00 – Welcome drink with orange juice, water, coffee, a tasting of compotes, and the gift of the “Harvest Kit” (t-shirt and straw hat).\r\n11:30 – Guided vineyard tour with grape picking and technical explanations provided by the guides.\r\nGuided tour of the Winery, with technical explanations by the guides.\r\n\r\nGuided tour of the Winery with expert winemaker explanations.\r\n\r\nVisit to the barrel cellar. Wine tasting of Santa Vitória wines with regional appetizers (includes a gift: 1 bottle of Santa Vitória Seleção wine).\r\n\r\n13:30 – Lunch at the Alentejo Vineyards Hotel restaurant (wine-pairing menu with Santa Vitória wines).\r\n15:30 – End of lunch and time to enjoy additional program activities.\r\n16:30 – Departure.",
