    "description": "Join us for a Traditional Slovenian Folklore Evening and experience the country through the things that bring people together: good food, local wine, music, dance, stories, and genuine hospitality.\r\n\r\nOne Evening. A Taste of Slovenia.\r\nEnjoy a traditional three-course Slovenian dinner while live musicians and dancers bring the country's rich cultural heritage to life.\r\n\r\nYour evening includes:\r\n\r\nTraditional Slovenian cuisine\r\nLocal wine and a warm Slovenian welcome\r\nLive folk music\r\nTraditional regional dances\r\nBeautiful Slovenian folk costumes\r\nFun activities and guest participation\r\nA small gift to remember your evening\r\n\r\nYou can simply sit back and enjoy the performance—or join in with a dance, a game, or a toast. No experience is required, just a sense of adventure!\r\n\r\nPerfect for Travelers & Groups\r\nWhether you're visiting Ljubljana as a couple, with family and friends, or as part of an organized tour, our folklore evening offers an easy and entertaining way to discover Slovenian traditions.\r\n\r\nTravel agencies and tour groups are warmly welcome, with groups of 10 or more accommodated.\r\n\r\nGive your guests more than a dinner. Give them an evening they will remember long after they leave Slovenia.",
