    "description": "You are invited to discover Segovia by land and air in this amazing tour.\r\n\r\nRevel in an amazing experience flying over the city of Segovia, driven solely by the wind. Ride up to the heavens in a hot air balloon from the outskirts of Segovia.\r\n\r\nThe 1-hour flight over the city of Segovia always takes place first thing in the morning, taking advantage of the weather conditions and the gentle breezes at dawn. You will arrive at the take-off point with enough time to observe the inflation of the balloon and receive instructions from its pilot.\r\n\r\nDuring the flight over the aqueduct, the Cathedral and the old royal palace and fortress - the Alcázar Real, you can reach heights of up to 1,000 meters. You will receive pictures and videos taken during the flight, an expert pilot with years of experience shows you all the details of how the balloon works.\r\n\r\nA ceremony will be held at the end of the flight with champagne, breakfast and a certificate when you land. Continue your day with a guided tour from our official guide, where you can explore the most important monuments and buildings of the city of Segovia.",
