    "tourProgramExample": "Starting from your hotel, your guide will pick you up and your journey to the Duero will begin. The trip is about an hour and a half to the world-famous Abadía de Retuerta. This wine project was started by the Swiss group Novartis with the idea of producing cutting-edge products. They are now shaping some of the best wines in Spain and are internationally recognized by top wine critics like Parker.\r\n\r\nThe winemaker will bring you into the vineyards for a wine safari by Land Rover, touring the whole estate, then discovering the production line and finally\r\ntasting 3 of those amazing blends.\r\n\r\nLater, you will go to the beautiful town of Peñafiel, an amazing site overlooked by a medieval castle that dominates the village. After having visited all the\r\nlandmarks you’ll be able to lunch on your own in one of its many restaurants.\r\n\r\nThe second winery of this Day-Trip in Ribera del Duero is the quintessence of this wine region: Protos. Here you will discover another scale of the winery and how this local family founded the fame of an entire region. This is the absolute Duero experience.",
