    "description": "Karting is a motor racing discipline that is practised with karts on circuits called kart tracks, which are between 600 and 1700 metres long, and between 8 and 15 metres wide. Given its characteristics, the kart is the driver training modality par excellence: it is usually the first car in which aspiring competition drivers make their debut. Our Go karting activity will make your business event a unique experience.\r\n\r\nYou will experience all the thrill of competition on our tracks. Their design and protection systems guarantee maximum safety and entertainment. All this under the quality seal of Carlos Sainz, a real tailor-made Grand Prix!\r\n\r\nThe competition on the tracks is the most entertaining part of our events. You can choose between an individual competition and a relay race. Our customers compete following the Formula 1 system, with warm-up round, qualifying session and final championship from the starting grid.",
