    "description": "Toni Kroos Academy: The Ultimate Destination for Young Footballers Aiming to Reach Their Full Potential!\r\n\r\nConceived, guided and inspired by one of the world’s best footballers. Toni Kroos brings the most important impulses from his successful career as a professional footballer to the Academy.\r\n\r\nTher high-performance academy is designed to offer comprehensive and advanced training. At Toni Kroos Academy, they provide an environment conducive to both athletic and personal growth through our competitive teams, specialized technical training, and training camps.\r\n\r\nHere, each player will have the opportunity to refine their skills, learn from the best, and pave their way toward success in the football world.\r\n\r\nIn an unparalleled environment, surrounded by nature and with more than 20,000 square meters dedicated to the practice of football, TKA features 4 football fields (F11, F7, F5 with a roof, and mini football), along with a building that includes changing rooms and offices.\r\n \r\nApart from the club and teams, they will operate as an academy, and therefore, they will offer personal training, player development sessions, goalkeeper training, and more.\r\n\r\nThe sports director of the academy will be Toni Kroos, and below him, there will be a team of certified coaches with the level of expertise required by the academy. \r\n\r\nhttps://www.tonikroos-academy.es/",
