    "description": "At the Hacienda, with more than five centuries of olive oil tradition behind them, thet strive to provide exquisite culinary experiences for lovers of good taste through their olive oils.\r\n\r\n4 VARIETAL EXPERIENCE\r\n\r\n1. Guided tour of Hacienda Guzmán:\r\n- Old mill: learn how oil was produced between the 16th and 19th centuries.\r\n- Olive mill: learn about oil production, the differences between virgin and extra virgin olive oil, the enemies of olive oil, etc.\r\n- Olive museum: 150 varieties from 14 different countries. We'll mention the most popular varieties. Learn about harvesting techniques, ideal harvesting times, oil yield, olive oil production percentages, etc.\r\n- Carriage museum: private collection of horse-drawn carriages.\r\n- Andalusian patios.\r\n\r\n2. Premium extra virgin olive oil tasting: taste oils from different varieties and identify their aromas and flavors.\r\n\r\n3. Bottle of extra virgin olive oil.\r\n\r\nDuration: 1.5 hours. Rate: €55/person (21% VAT included).\r\n\r\nTerms and Conditions:\r\n- Tours are conducted by bilingual staff in English. Other languages, including French, German, and Italian, are available. Additional languages ​​are subject to additional charges.\r\n- Tours canceled within 48 hours will be charged at 50%.\r\nTours canceled on the same day will be charged at 100%.\r\n- Prices are net and always per person.\r\n- Prices based on groups of more than 10 people.",
