    "tags": [
      "Food",
      "Gastronomic food",
      "Local food"
    ],
    "description": "AN ACTIVITY FULL OF FLAVOR\r\nHam Tastings\r\nThe ham and pork product tasting, including all kinds of select cuts from Iberian pork, is led and directed by Anselmo Pérez, Spain’s ham-slicing champion, and his team of top professionals, all based on products of the highest quality.\r\n\r\nWHO IS IT FOR?\r\nFor individuals or groups visiting the city of Salamanca who are interested in learning about the city’s gastronomic culture. Activities can be adapted to different cultures and ages depending on the need.\r\n\r\nWHAT DO OUR ACTIVITIES INCLUDE AND HOW LONG DO THEY LAST?\r\nYou can choose from a wide variety of gastronomic/tourist services with different durations. Everything can be tailored to the client’s needs thanks to the wide range of possibilities offered by Iberian pork.\r\n\r\n\r\nBasic tasting of ham, shoulder, and typical cured Iberian products from Salamanca (loin, lomito, chorizo, salchichón, morcón, assorted sausages, etc.), including water, wine, and soft drinks for tasting. Duration: 30 min\r\n\r\n\r\nTasting of ham, shoulder, and typical cured Iberian products from Salamanca (loin, lomito, chorizo, salchichón, morcón, assorted sausages, etc.) with explanations and audiovisual support so the client can see where they come from and how they are made, including water and wine for tasting. Duration: 45–60 min\r\n\r\n\r\nTasting of ham, shoulder, and typical cured Iberian products from Salamanca (loin, lomito, chorizo, salchichón, morcón, assorted sausages, etc.), plus a selection of premium cuts from Iberian pork (pluma, secreto, presa, lagarto, magro, abanico, cheeks, ribs, etc.) cooked on the spot in our restaurant kitchen, with explanations and audiovisual support so the client can see where they come from and how they are made, including water, wine, and soft drinks for tasting. Duration: 60–90 min\r\n\r\n\r\nThemed lunches or dinners based on Iberian pork culture to sample all the culinary delights it offers, with audiovisual animations and all kinds of explanations related to the Iberian products we serve (ham, shoulder, loin, chorizo, salchichón, assorted sausages, pluma, secreto, presa, lagarto, magro, abanico, cheeks, ribs, etc.). Approximate duration: 2 hours",
