    "description": "These are guided tours designed to explore the history and most interesting sites of the city. With the help of Virtual Reality, we travel back in time to see how the city and its monuments were and how they have evolved over time. \r\n\r\nThe unique aspect is that, for the first time, this experience is offered while visiting the monument itself.\r\n\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DgfJVwDGV5w",
    "tourProgramExample": "Welcome to the exciting \"Time Travel Through Madrid\" tour! Embark on a captivating journey through the annals of history with Fun And Tickets and Imageen Reliving History, bringing you an unparalleled experience. Immerse yourself in Madrid's captivating past, enhanced with cutting-edge virtual reality technology. Prepare to be transported back in time as we explore centuries of history and culture.\r\n\r\nOur meticulously curated tour promises to guide participants through a tapestry of Madrid's most important landmarks, while leveraging state-of-the-art virtual reality technology to bring the past to life. As you embark on this immersive adventure, prepare to witness the evolution of Madrid's iconic sites, from the grandeur of the Royal Palace to the vibrant energy of Puerta del Sol.\r\n\r\nJoin us on this extraordinary exploration, whether you're a history buff, a tech enthusiast, or simply looking for a unique and unforgettable experience.",
    "officialWebsite": "https://imageen.net/en/",
