    "tags": [
      "Nature",
      "Landscape",
      "Animal",
      "Traditional"
    ],
    "description": "CampoToro is a perfect destination for authentic bullfighting experiences in Madrid. They offer a diverse range of activities, including baby bull running, stag do events, fighting bull ranch tours, and private family tours. Their mission is to immerse visitors in the rich traditions of Spanish bullfighting while highlighting the ecological significance and beauty of the bull in its natural habitat.\r\n\r\nExperience the thrill and tradition of a fighting bull ranch tour in Madrid like never before.\r\n\r\nThey offer a wide range of bullfighting activities for all types of groups:\r\n\r\n- Family Tours: Engage in educational and entertaining experiences suitable for all ages, where families can learn about the cultural significance of bullfighting in a safe and animal-friendly environment.\r\n\r\n- Baby Bull Running: Feel the adrenaline rush with our baby bull running events, designed to provide excitement while maintaining the utmost respect for the animals.\r\n\r\n- Bullfighting Experiences: Witness the art of bullfighting through our immersive tours and live events, led by passionate professionals.\r\n\r\n- Private Bullfighting Shows: Experience exclusive performances, including traditional bullfighting and recortadores (bull leapers), tailored to your preferences for an intimate insight into this iconic tradition.\r\n\r\n- Stag Do Madrid: Make your stag do in Madrid truly unforgettable with a one-of-a-kind bullfighting adventure or a wild baby bull running event in Madrid.\r\n\r\n- Fighting Bull Ranch Tours: Explore a fighting bull ranch near Madrid, where you’ll learn about the breeding, training, and care of these majestic animals.\r\n\r\n- Equestrian Experiences: Get involved in rejoneo (Spanish horseback bullfighting) or enjoy scenic horseback riding tours across the beautiful countryside.\r\n\r\n- Adventurous Group Activities: From baby bull running to thrilling bullfighting challenges, we cater to those seeking a daring, unforgettable group activity.",
