    "salesNotes": "Languages: Spanish, English, French, German\r\n\r\nSchedule:\r\nRegular visit with other guests at 11:00 am, Monday to Saturday (maximum 20 participants)\r\n\r\nPrivate visits at other morning or afternoon times. Duration adapted to the client’s needs (on request)\r\n\r\nGroup visits. Schedules adapted to the group. Availability upon request",
