    "description": "The art of gathering around the table. At Kampada, cooking is more than following recipes. It’s about coming together, sharing stories and celebrating our culture around the table.\r\n\r\nTheir culinary experiences are an invitation into Barcelona’s heart: a way to discover authentic flavors, guided by local chefs, in a warm and welcoming space. Whether you come with friends, family, colleagues or on your own, you’ll find that food has a special way of connecting people.\r\n\r\n​Join them in the kitchen, raise a glass of wine, and take home more than just recipes: take home memories, conversations, and a little piece of our city.",
