    "description": "Experience Atleti like never before! Feel the red-and-white legacy from the inside by going around the stadium and the red-and-white history.\r\n\r\nGet ready for a unique experience inside the Riyadh Air Metropolitano, one of the most spectacular and modern stadiums in Europe. Walk through the same spaces that the first team players step onto on match day: their circular dressing room, mixed zone, tunnel to the pitch, their benches and even the mythical press conference room, where Cholo Simeone speaks to the media.\r\n\r\nAnd that's not all: access the exclusive presidential box with unique views of the pitch and the stadium as a whole. You will feel the excitement of elite football as if you were part of the team!\r\n\r\nThe experience continues in our Interactive Museum, an immersive tour of our over 120 years of red-and-white history. Through touch screens, virtual reality glasses, projections and games, you will feel the most glorious moments of Atleti in your own skin.\r\n\r\nTo further enrich your experience, during the purchase process you can add an audioguide, available in Spanish and English.",
