    "description": "Madrid at Its Most Unexpected — Where Contemporary Art Finds Its Place\r\n\r\nComplementing the exploration of local talent and craftsmanship is “Carabanchel: Madrid’s Contemporary Art District”, an exclusive experience that invites guests to discover one of the city’s most vibrant and surprising creative hubs.\r\n\r\nDeparting from The Palace Hotel Madrid, this experience introduces guests to a neighborhood that has successfully reinvented itself, transforming its industrial past into one of the driving forces behind Madrid’s contemporary art scene. Former printing houses, textile workshops, and mechanical spaces now shape a thriving artistic landscape where galleries, studios, and creators have found a place to foster new forms of expression.\r\n\r\nThis private tour includes visits to a curated selection of four or five galleries carefully chosen by Marta Turégano for their relevance within today’s art scene. The experience also offers exclusive access to artists’ studios in the area, providing the opportunity to gain insight into their creative processes and engage directly with the artists themselves.\r\n\r\nThe experience includes transportation by minivan, with pick-up and return service to The Palace Hotel Madrid, ensuring comfort and continuity throughout the journey. As a final touch, the visit concludes with a traditional Spanish wine gathering in one of the creative spaces, encouraging a close and personal connection between art, artists, and visitors.",
