    "description": "A close and authentic experience where you’ll discover how the city’s famous yemas are made. In an emblematic setting within the historic center, you’ll learn about the pastry tradition that has made this Ávila sweet so renowned, and you’ll get hands‑on practice shaping your own pieces.\r\n\r\nThe atmosphere is relaxed, with small groups so you can follow every gesture of the master and enjoy the process without rushing.\r\n\r\nIn addition to learning the technique, you’ll take home your finished box and enjoy a final tasting to appreciate the nuances and textures. The activity is suitable for curious visitors of all ages and is offered at different times to fit your visit to the city. \r\n\r\nIf you’re drawn to traditional crafts and enjoy working with your hands, the Santa Teresa Yemas Workshop – Ávila is a simple and delightful way to connect with a local symbol.\r\n\r\n- Taught by a leading pastry shop in Ávila.\r\n- Small groups; close guidance from the master.\r\n- Includes tasting with a drink.\r\n- Final box with 12 units.\r\n- Brand: Santa Teresa Gourmet. Origin: Ávila Auténtica.\r\n- Located in the heart of the historic center.",
