    "description": "In the heart of Madrid, between Calle de Alcalá and Gran Vía, and just a stone’s throw from Puerta del Sol, you will find this brand-new innovative immersive museum. It proposes an interactive journey that invites us to explore how we perceive reality through our senses and how the brain can reinterpret what we believe we see, hear or feel.\r\n\r\nThe museum offers a sensory, participatory experience focused on perception, balance and the mind. Through more than 50 immersive installations, optical illusions, spaces challenge your sense of direction and proposals designed to activate sight, hearing, touch and proprioception, visitors take the lead on a journey that combines science, entertainment and wonder.",
