    "description": "Contracted WINTERLAKEN.\r\n\r\nFind your way through the snow guided only by the light cast by the torches - and the local knowledge of your guides.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to greeting you at the meeting point and then heading over to where we will set out for the torchlight hike. Enjoy complete tranquility and stillness as you walk fully focused along the path illuminated by the torches. Each step you take in the snow is a fantastic (auditory) experience.\r\n\r\nAlong the way, enjoy some mulled wine or a cup of tea served from the firepot and gaze up at the delightful starry sky and mystical snowy landscape in the darkness. On request, we can also serve refreshments made with high-quality products from the Jungfrau region.\r\n\r\nThis event is designed to facilitate team building:\r\nA peaceful saunter through the winter landscape helps to make open dialogue a fixture of your company’s culture while at the same time building a foundation for communication in ways that are much different from the daily workplace routine, both in terms of the scenery and interpersonal interaction.",
