    "description": "Explore the city of Zurich from a different perspective ‒ in the course of an active leisure pursuit of a very special kind!\r\nOn this guided tour, you will discover some of Zurich´s history-steeped places of interest from the water – standing on a paddling board. Participants are introduced to the art of stand-up paddling and at the same time learn all kinds of interesting historical facts about the city of Zurich along its waterways.\r\nSee zurich from a different angle with the stand-up paddle board tour. Learn the cities history as you go along it's waterways.\r\nPrivate Tours are available in Spanish, German, English, French.",
    "tourProgramExample": "There are different tours available:\r\n\r\n-SUP Basic Courses: 90 minutes. Our basic course is the easiest and fastest way for beginners to learn the basics in just 90 minutes. Our experienced instructors will teach you the absolute basics so that you can move safely and confidently on the water. Group size: min. 3 – max. 8 people.\r\n\r\n-SUP – Private Lessons: 60 minutes. Would you like to experience new challenges on the water and be supported by a professional instructor? Then our Stand Up Paddle private lessons are just right for you! We offer you the opportunity to fully concentrate on your Stand Up Paddle experience by scheduling a personal appointment with one of our experienced instructors. You will benefit from his undivided attention, the tranquility of a one-to-one course and individual advice. Our flexible offer allows you to arrange individual programs once or over several weeks in order to prepare yourself specifically for specific goals. Group size: min 1- max.8 people\r\n\r\n-Basic courses for a great start to the season:  5 x 75 min. Our stand-up paddle basic beginner courses are just right for anyone looking for the perfect start to exciting water sports. Our experienced instructors will teach you all the basics so you can stand safely and confidently on your board and master the waves. From the right paddling technique to choosing the perfect equipment, we provide you with a solid base to start your paddling summer on time. Our courses are specifically designed for newcomers, so you don't need any previous experience to participate. With our help, you can learn how to find your way around the board and enjoy the water in no time. Group size: min. 4 – max. 10 people.\r\n\r\n-Advanced courses for more fun on the water: 60 min. If you already have experience in stand-up paddling and want to take your technique to the next level, we have just the thing for you! Our advanced SUP course is specifically designed to help experienced paddlers like you improve their skills and refine their paddling. In our course you will be supervised by experienced trainers who will give you valuable feedback and help you perfect your technique. You will learn how to optimize your paddle strokes and improve your stability on the board. We will also teach you advanced paddling techniques that will allow you to safely master even difficult waters. Group size: min. 4 – max. 10 people.",
    "officialWebsite": "http://supkultur.ch/",
    "capacityMin": 1,
    "capacityMax": 10,
    "capacityDetails": "Capacity varies based on the chosen tour.\r\nCan run events up to 120 people with food, workshop, sport incl.",
