    "tourProgramExample": "-1 hour or 1.5 hour round trip around Davos\r\nTo Dischma Valley - Restaurant Teufi 1 hour one way or including a stay of 1.5hours and back also with horse carriage\r\n- To Sertig Valley - Restaurant Walserhuus 1.5 hour one way or including a stay of 1.5 hours (for lunch) and back also with horse Carriage.",
