    "description": "Cheese lovers, rejoice! Get ready to dive headfirst into this delicious tradition at the Clavadeleralp Show Dairy. \r\n\r\nBe prepared to be amazed as fresh milk undergoes a magical transformation into mouthwatering alpine cheese right before your eyes. Meet 60 adorable Brown Swiss cows, the ultimate milk suppliers, and uncover the secrets behind the intricate cheese-making process. It's a moo-velous experience you won't want to miss!\r\n\r\nDaily tours from 10:00 to 11:30 are followed by an alpine brunch featuring regional specialities like alp cheese and pear bread. Access the alp via a small bus with a local driver (permit required) or take the cable car from Jakobshorn Valley station up to Ischalp for a scenic 40-minute to 1-hour hike. Alternatively, it's reachable by E-Bike in just 45 minutes.",
    "tourProgramExample": "Access the alp via a small bus with a local driver (permit required) or take the cable car from Jakobshorn Valley station up to Ischalp for a scenic 40-minute to 1-hour hike. Alternatively, it's reachable by E-Bike in just 45 minutes.\r\n\r\nDaily tours from 10:00 to 11:30 \r\nAdditional an alpine brunch featuring regional specialities like alp cheese and pear bread can be booked after the tour from 11:30.\r\n\r\nGroups must bring their own interpreter (they only speak German)",
