    "description": "Experience the serene beauty of Davos's landscape with the ease and speed of modern e-bikes. The state-of-the-art e-bikes allow riders to travel faster or with less effort, enabling complete immersion in nature while exploring the breathtaking surroundings.\r\n\r\nThe Bike Academy in Davos is the gateway to personalised e-bike experiences, offering rental services and guided tours for all skill levels. Groups of up to 8 people per guide are welcome, with flexibility for larger groups. Opt for short tours lasting for 2-3 hours or full-day excursions with a technical introduction. The experienced guides will adapt the routes to suit both seasoned riders and beginners, ensuring a tailored and memorable experience. Fluent in English, the guides are knowledgeable about the local landscape and history, guaranteeing an informative and enjoyable ride.\r\n\r\nGuided or self-guided tours can seamlessly incorporate lunch stops, often in the picturesque side valleys such as Dischma and Sertig. Enjoy a meal at the Walserhuus Restaurant in Sertig Valley or Teufi Restaurant in Dischma Valley.",
