    "description": "Embark on a thrilling adventure to the summit of Mount Titlis. Begin with the Titlis Express gondola and switch to the TITLIS Rotair, the world’s first revolving cable car. At 3,062 meters, enjoy stunning 360° views of the Engelberg valley and a view straight down into the abyss with crevasses carved into the glacial ice. Experience the magic of winter at Mount Titlis with the “My First Snow Experience” at SnowXpark Trübsee.\r\n\r\nKT Special Winter Rates\r\n\r\nTitlis Cliff Walk\r\nCross Europe’s highest suspension bridge at 3,041 meters. The 150-step adventure offers breathtaking views of the majestic mountain backdrop.\r\n\r\nGlacier Cave\r\nExplore a 150-meter-long glacier cave with ice crystals and shimmering blue ice. Dress warmly, as temperatures stay below -1°C.\r\n\r\nSki Experience\r\nPerfect for beginners, this one-hour ski lesson includes all equipment and a guide. Available daily from mid December to mid-April, at 10:00 or 15:00. Suitable for 1-40 persons. \r\n\r\nE-Snowmobile Experience\r\nRace across the snow with your friends on e-snowmobiles. \r\nAvailable daily from mid-December to mid-April, from 9:30 to 16:00. Suitable for 10-40 persons. \r\n\r\nTrübsee Igloo Experience\r\nEnjoy a Cheese Fondue and hot drink inside a man-made igloo. Available daily from mid-December to mid-April. From 10:00 to 15:30. Suitable for 5-40 Persons Reservations required. \r\n\r\nSnowtubing Experience\r\nHave fun with snow tubing, minibobs, and balancers in the snowpark. Available daily from mid-December to early May, from 10:00 to 16:45.",
