    "description": "The Funky Chocolate Club in Interlaken offers a unique and interactive chocolate workshop where participants can dive into the art of Swiss chocolate making. Guided by expert chocolatiers, you'll learn about the history of chocolate, tempering techniques, and get hands-on experience creating your own chocolate creations.\r\n\r\nThe workshop is designed for chocolate lovers of all ages and includes tastings of high-quality Swiss chocolate. At the end, you'll leave with your handmade chocolate masterpieces, making it a fun and delicious experience that captures the essence of Switzerland’s chocolate heritage.\r\n\r\nPublic and Private Workshops available.",
    "tourProgramExample": "The workshop times will be : 12:00 / 14:00 / 16:00 / 18:00 pm in the summer months (May 1st to September 30th) and in Winter during the week 14:00 / 16:00, (October till April) and weekends again 4 workshops a day. \r\nPlease always feel free to contact them to see if they have more availability or if you need another scheduled time, they try their best to accommodate your requests.\r\n \r\nThey will be closing from November 3rd to November 20th this year. \r\n\r\nWinter opening times: \r\nMon-Tues Closed\r\nWed-Thur 12:00 - 19:00\r\nFrid - Sat 12:00 - 21:00\r\nSun- 12:00 - 19:00",
