    "description": "Experience the magic of the Alpstein mountains, set in one of the most beautiful natural parks in Europe.\r\n\r\nGlide up to 2,502 meters above sea level in just 10 minutes – the trip from the Schwägalp pass to the Säntis is an experience in itself.\r\n\r\nDid you know that there is still a glacier on the Säntis, and that the ice of the glacier is blue? At ànstis - the world of ice, you can enjoy fascinationg encounters with all things ice and snow. Wander through the ice ages and lea all about the \"jewels of the sky\" and you can even touch, play and experiment with ice here.\r\n\r\nIn the nature discovery park, which is located in the center of a wide network of hiking trails. Both new and experienced mountain hikers will get their money’s worth. Whether you’re on a casual stroll or a mountain tour, we know you’ll marvel at the natural surroundings and tranquility of this incredible region.",
