    "description": "This is a new exclusive DELUXE product of the Lake Lucerne Navigation Company.\r\n\r\nExperience an exquisite five-course menu, prepared\r\nfrom regional ingredients, accompanied by first-class service.\r\nImmerse yourself in the rich legends and breathtaking beauty of Lake Lucerne and its surroundings during this four-hour journey, designed for a limited number of guests to ensure a tranquil and spacious setting.\r\n\r\nListen to fascinating stories of the region and learn more about the cultural heritage of Switzerland, while gaining exclusive insights into the operation of the steamship as you glide over the still waters, surrounded by the majestic Alps in the heart of Switzerland. Let the calming sound of the waves enchant you and create unforgettable emories\r\naboard this extraordinary cruise, known as ”Legends of Lake Lucerne”.",
