    "description": "Families of growers-vintners have created the terrain of Lavaux over the centuries.\r\n\r\nDay after day these wine artisans work towards the quality of the final product. At Vinorama you will find the largest assortment of Lavaux wines.\r\n\r\nA particular grape varietal will develop a specific character depending on the nature of the soil in which it is grown. Get an insight into the compositions of the 8 areas of production in Lavaux, thanks to our geoliths. Cross-sections of sub-surface soil, created by H. Detomasi. The principal grape varietals of Lavaux can be found growing on the site, alongside the South parking area.",
    "tourProgramExample": "Film 'A winemaker's year' is included in all the packages (20 min, available in French, German, Italian, English, Spanish, Japanese, Mandarin, Russian)\r\n\r\nPackages:\r\n- Wine tasting of 3 red wines - The RED package\r\n- Wine tasting of 3 white wines - The CHASSELAS package\r\n- Wine tasting of 2 white and 1 red wine - The DISCOVERY package\r\n- Wine tasting of 1 white and 1 red wine - Package 2 wines\r\n- Wine tasting of 3 white and 2 red wines - The Expert package\r\n- Wine tasting of 1 red wine - Package 1 red wine\r\n- Wine tasting of 1 white wine - Package 1 white win\r\n\r\nAperiif plate only available from 10 Pax",
