    "description": "Barryland is a pioneering project funded by the Barry Foundation, which works to protect, breed and promote St. Bernard dogs.\r\n\r\nCompleted in just under two years, this theme park welcomes you to modern, spacious and completely refurbished surroundings, offering you an immersive experience entirely dedicated to St. Bernard dogs. Replacing the old museum established in an old arsenal, it is a breath of fresh air for the foundation and the public. Thanks to its new infrastructures, Barryland Theme Park can now double its visitor capacity and fully cater to the growing interest of the public visiting from Switzerland and across the world.",
    "tourProgramExample": "Entrance RATE (from 1 Pax)\r\nChildren from 6 to 20 years old\r\nChildren under 6 years old : Free of charge\r\n\r\nSPECIAL PACKAGE : (Group from 10 people onwards)\r\n1)\tEntrance + Group photo with St Bernard dog \r\n\r\n2)\tEntrance + Group photo with St Bernard dog + 3 course lunch at Le Café de Barry restaurant\r\n\r\n3)\tEntrance + Group photo with St Bernard dog + 30min meet & greet the dogs.\r\n\r\nConditions : \r\n-\tSize of group: min. 10 people. Meet & greet with the dogs: max. 20 people per group (larger groups must be split). \r\n-\tDrinks not included in the menu price. \r\n-\tMeet & greets with the dogs are subject to availability and are limited to a set number per day. \r\n-\tMeet & greets with the dogs may be cancelled if the group is late (no refund). \r\n-\tVisitors always meet the dogs under the supervision of Barryland staff whose instructions must be followed at all times. Inappropriate conduct can result in immediate expulsion from the meet & greet.\r\n\r\n- Restaurant available: 120 seats",
