    "description": "Landquart Fashion Outlet is Switzerland’s largest open-air premium outlet shopping destination, designed in charming Swiss chalet-style architecture. Home to around 160 fashion and lifestyle brands across 85 stores, it offers year-round savings of up to 70%, making it a key shopping highlight for visitors.\r\n\r\nThe outlet features a variety of restaurants and cafés, creating a pleasant and convenient shopping experience. Guests benefit from excellent accessibility, with a direct train station (“Landquart”) just a 3-minute walk away and only 1 hour from Zurich main station.\r\nThe location is ideal, just 10 minutes from Chur and Bad Ragaz, 1 hour from Zurich and Davos, and 90 minutes from Lucerne.\r\n\r\nVisitors will also receive a VIP Day Pass, granting an additional 10% discount in participating stores.\r\n\r\nThe centre will introduce 15 new stores, additional brands, and innovative gastronomy concepts by spring 2026.",
