    "description": "Smilestones is an indoor miniature world attraction located near the Rhine Falls, showcasing detailed and interactive scenes of Swiss landscapes and everyday life.\r\n\r\nVisitors can explore finely crafted models featuring moving trains, vehicles, and hidden details, making it an engaging and weather-independent activity.\r\n\r\nThey also offer a Rhine Falls Ticket, which combines admission to Smilestones with a 30-minute boat trip. In addition, the Rhyfall Express (choo-choo train) can be arranged to transfer guests to the boat station. This service can also be chartered exclusively (capacity: 46 passengers), making it a convenient option for groups.",
    "tourProgramExample": "Different products:\r\n\r\n- Smilestones Short stay Self-visit 45min\r\n- Smilestone Self visit (around 1 - 1.5hours)\r\n\r\n- Guided Tour takes around 45-50minutes and is available in English, French & German.\r\n\r\n- They also offer a Rhine Falls Ticket, which combines admission to Smilestones with a 30-minute boat trip. In addition, the Rhyfall Express (choo-choo train) can be arranged to transfer guests to the boat station. This service can also be chartered exclusively (capacity: 46 passengers), making it a convenient option for groups.",
