    "description": "Immerse yourself in the unique world of chocolate at the Fuchs workshop in Zermatt.\r\n\r\nWhether individually or in a private group of up to twelve participants, you will be guided by expert chocolatiers to create your own Matterhörnli – a truly unforgettable and delicious souvenir.\r\n\r\nEnhance your experience with an upgrade that includes a hot chocolate or coffee, along with a tasting of three in-house and regional specialties from Fuchs Bakery, accompanied by explanations.\r\n\r\nThe workshop can also be arranged with a Japanese interpreter upon request.",
    "tourProgramExample": "Workshop only: 60- 90 minutes incl.\r\n1.Short Visit of the Fuchs manufactory(Spissstrasse 99)\r\n2.Tasting of different quality chocolate couvertures\r\n3. 60-90 min Workshop make your own Chocolate Matterhornli Box of 15 pieces under the supervision of achocolatier\r\n3.Incl a give away Fuchs Bag\r\n4.unlimited coffee, tee and water\r\n5. free additional tour guide to translate the workshop if necessary\r\n-> if JPN workshop booked: includes already Interpreter ENG/German to JPN & Vice Versa included\r\n\r\nUpgrade Workshop 2 hours incl. additional:\r\nHot chocolate maison or coffee & tasting of three house and regional specialities from Fuchs Bakery with their explanations at Fuchs workshop (Spissstrasse 99)",
