    "description": "",
    "tourProgramExample": "Wake up your day on an exhilarating trip by RIB boat to the O2 arena. ​(duration +/- 30-40 min). ​\r\n\r\nOn arrival, we climb the iconic O2 arena to get a 360 view of the capital. ​(The maximum number of climbers is 30 per timeslot. ​Weight and age restrictions apply)​\r\n\r\nTry your hand at golf, or go for the crazy golf adventure instead with the O2 arena and the Thames in the background. ​\r\n\r\nTaste the world cuisine at Jimmy’s at the O2. ​\r\n\r\nAfter lunch we will take the Emirates Air Line to the other side of the river, where our coaches will take us for an Olympic adventure. ​\r\n\r\nIn the Queen Elizabeth Olympic Park, home of the London 2012 Olympics our adventure continues. ​\r\n\r\nTake a selfie in front of the Olympic Rings and Paralympic Agitos.​\r\n\r\nthe ArcelorMittal Orbit in a 40 second journey. ​experience the exhilarating descent of the UK’s highest freefall abseil and hold your breath as you step over the edge of the iconic red steel of the ArcelorMittal Orbit before taking the plunge and making an 80m adrenaline-fuelled journey to the ground. ​\r\n\r\nClose the day with free shopping time at the nearby Westfield Stratford before we make our way back to the hotel.",
