    "description": "The Copper Rivet Distillery is an exciting and dynamic, family owned and run Kent based craft distillery. \r\n\r\nA visit to this distillery is like a visit to the family’s home.\r\n\r\nRecently pronounced by King Charles III’s Wine and Spirit Merchant, Berry Brothers & Rudd, as producing “one of the best distillates in the UK, perhaps the world”.\r\n\r\nThey are one of the only single malt whisky, gin and vodka distilleries in the UK to work with local farms to grow their grain and, with a sustainable world in mind, work with those same farms to provide distillery by-products to feed their animals.\r\n\r\nAs the only spirit maker in Kent, and one of just a few in the UK that undertakes the complete process of brewing and distilling from farm to glass, they ensure their range of premium spirits is totally distinctive and unique.\r\n\r\nTake a visit and immerse yourself in a truly unique setting where you can see how they make and produce their complete range of spirits, explore and see first-hand the distilling process in action, play and experiment with flavour profiling and sip and savour some of their spirits.\r\n\r\nApproximately one hour by coach from London this distillery will make a wonderful complement for any full day tour into Kent.",
