    "description": "The Bristish Bake Off is one of the most famous TV shows to come out of the UK and you can now experience it yourself!\r\n\r\nDiscover a truly British, immersive baking experience with our supplier “The Big Bakes”. \r\n\r\nA most unique and memorable group activity when visiting the UK, where creativity, competition, and classic British experience come together under one iconic marquee. Whether it’s a team-building day, or a group trip, The Big Bakes offers an immersive and joyful way to experience British baking culture.\r\n\r\nThe Big Bakes private baking experiences are fully hosted, easy to access, and ideal for international groups looking to try something fun, hands-on, and self contained. With themed sessions tailored to Kuoni Tumlare groups, (see below for details) everything is provided - from ingredients to aprons - and their team ensures a smooth and engaging experience. \r\n\r\nEach baking session can accommodate up to 39 people, but larger groups can be split over different sessions.\r\n\r\nBakers can participate in pairs of up to 24 people, or 3s up to 36 (if there are the max 39 guests then one group of three will use the head baker's bench). \r\n\r\nLocated in both East London, (Haggerston), South London (Tooting), Birmingham (Digbeth), Liverpool and Manchester (Salford central), The Big Bakes a perfect alternative to the traditional city tour or afternoon activity—and a guaranteed crowd-pleaser for groups of all kinds, because who doesn't love cake? \r\n\r\nA perfect quintessential English baking experience!",
