    "description": "Discover a five-star distillery experience in the heart\r\nof the Scottish Lowlands. Once a family farm, Jackton\r\nDistillery has transformed into a premier tour and\r\nevent hire destination. Join their immersive distillery tour to explore the craftsmanship behind RAER Whisky, and Something Blue, the fabulous colour changing Wedding Gin!\r\n\r\nLearn about their origins and witness the creation of our premium spirits. Indulge in a guided tasting session featuring four spirit samples of your choice (whisky/gin/vodka) with mixers included.\r\n\r\nEnhance your visit with an overnight stay in their\r\ncharming on-site cottages, making your journey\r\nseamless and relaxing. Their tasting\r\nbar accommodates up to 70 guests.",
    "tourProgramExample": "Jackton Distillery 'After 164 hours' Tour and Tasting\r\n\r\nDiscover the intricate process of crafting premium whisky on the engaging distillery tour. As you are guided through the family farm-turned distillery, you will learn about the origins of RAER.\r\n\r\nOur tour offers an in-depth look at every step of whisky production, from malting and mashing to fermentation and distillation. Experience the unique flavours of Jackton Distillery with a tasting session featuring their Original RAER and three award winning first-fill sherry cask expressions. For those who prefer lighter spirits, they also produce exceptional vodka and gins. Perfect for whisky enthusiasts and novices alike, this tour is designed to be educational, entertaining, and intimate.",
