    "description": "An organic livestock farmer who started organic farming in 1994 and started raising buffalo in 2008.\r\n\r\nHe currently owns 60 buffalos, 15 cows, 2 pigs and turkeys, and operates a farm stand on the farm property.",
    "tourProgramExample": "<KKJO066709-09AUG18 NOKR50 \"AI) JA KOJ YAKUIN/19AUG\" & KKJO066710-16SEP18 NOKR50 \"AI) JA KOJ YAKUIN/16SEP\">\r\n\r\n☆ Date and time\r\n\r\nFROM AUG 19: Monday, August 20, 2018, 1700-1800\r\n16SEP departure: Monday, September 17, 2018, 1700-1800\r\n\r\n☆Number of people\r\n\r\n15-20+1 on both departure dates\r\n\r\n☆Contact\r\n\r\nMs. Julia Kocher\r\n\r\n☆Program example\r\n\r\nFacility Tour\r\nThe tour language is German.\r\n\r\n☆Inspection fee\r\n\r\nEUR 11 P/P\r\n\r\n☆Conditions\r\n\r\nReviewing.\r\n\r\n----------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n＜TYO-1304 Inspection of local production for local consumption in VIE,MUC,NAP,ROM  (NOSAN SEMINAR)＞Investigation of\r\n\r\nI received the next offer from Mr. Kocher, but then canceled due to a competitive loss.\r\n\r\nDate: Tuesday, October 11, 2016\r\nTime: TBA\r\n\r\nSubstance:\r\nProgram (1)\r\nWelcome drink\r\nShort Film Presentation\r\nGaiting tours and refreshments (buffalo meat and soft drinks)\r\n\r\nProgram (2) with meals\r\nWelcome drink\r\nShort Film Presentation\r\nMir (menu)\r\nBuffalo Soup & warm dish  and non-alcoholic drink - Coffee and cake\r\nBuffalo warm dish: (it is possible to choose one from following dishes)\r\n- Stew and bread\r\n- Juice meat with noodles or dumplings\r\n- Bison Burger\r\n\r\nFee:\r\nProgram (1) EUR 18.00 per person\r\nProgram (2) EUR24.00 per person\r\n\r\n=Important Notes=\r\nMinimum number of payers: 20, maximum number of recipients 50\r\nInterpretation is free of charge\r\n\r\nPayment terms: Invoice settlement after visit\r\nCancellation conditions (actual schedule): There is no cancellation fee if you cancel by 9/30 (Friday).\r\nLate cancellations will incur a full cancellation fee.",
