    "description": "Ile = de = France Region is a regional area centered on Paris, the capital of France, and is a metropolitan area of France with 7 departments with the capital of Paris. One of the characteristics of agriculture in this area is its proximity to urban areas.\r\n\r\nThe Île=de=France Regional Chamber of Agriculture is a public institution established in 1968 as the Chamber of Agriculture with jurisdiction over the region. It is a public institution that represents the rights and interests of agricultural government and agribusiness-related workers, and provides various services such as advice and information to all investors and promotion of programs.",
    "tourProgramExample": "YYJO060331-02OCT19 NOKH04 A) NOGYO TV NL BE FR 10 (GRQ NGO-0192) 32+1+1IN \r\n* It was OK, but it was canceled due to a schedule change, so only information (2019.8.06).\r\n\r\n*Person leading the visit is Madame Coralie Pothon &#8211; Head of Marketing Tel +33 1 39234200\r\n\r\nDate: Oct. 8, 2019(Tuesday) 10.30-12.00\r\nDuration: 1 1/2 hours\r\nNumber of people: 30\r\n\r\nVisit Address: In Annexe 2, 15 rue de Plateau Saint Antoine, 78150 LE CHESNAY\r\n\r\nExample program: lecture, Q&A.\r\n　　　　　　　　*Topics: Île=de=French Regional Chamber of Agriculture and French agriculture, etc.\r\n\r\nCost (tax incl.): EUR600.- per group including VAT \r\n\r\nCondition: Prepayment\r\n\r\n★postscript★\r\nMinimum 10 people and maximum 30 people, so we are checking to see if it is okay to have a little more than 30 people.\r\n\r\n-----------------------------------\r\n\r\nTTAO231006-06JUL18 NOKA05 A)CTS IWA SORACHI JA LON/PAR 8 (GRQ TYO-1553) 18+1 *Information only \r\n* Although I had promised, the visit in France was only for banks and CXLD.\r\n\r\nDate: Jul. 10, 2018(Tuesday) 14.30-16.30\r\n*Originally, OK came on Wednesday, July 11, 2018, but it can also be done in the afternoon of July 10.\r\n\r\nSample program (2 hours): lecture, Q&A session.\r\n\r\nLecture topics: Île=de=French Regional Chamber of Agriculture and French agriculture.\r\n\r\nCost (tax included): EUR600.- per group including VAT for 2hrs meeeting\r\n\r\nPayment method: Until now, the invoice payment after the visit was changed to CXL when I was told that PD was required at the time of commitment. Please confirm the payment method the next time you inquire.\r\n\r\n---------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nTTAO215058-17OCT17 NOKD03 A) NOGYO NEWS PAPER (GRQ TYO-1445) 16+1+INTP  \r\n\r\nPIC: Ms. Elise Simon (communication department) : 06.07.15.48.19\r\nTel: 0033 1 39 23 42 17 or 0033 1 39 23 42 16\r\ncommunication@ile-de-france.chambagri.fr\r\n\r\nDate: Tuesday, October 24, 2017, 09:30-11:30 AM => Change to 9.00-11.00 OK\r\nMeeting point: Building lobby. Upon arrival, Ms. Read Simon.\r\nProgram Content: Lecture\r\n- About French agriculture\r\n- The role of the Chamber of Agriculture\r\n- Q&A\r\n\r\nLanguage: French (Interpretation must be arranged). \r\n\r\nTV fee:　EUR600p/group Included TTC\r\nPAYMENT: \tBank transfer to be invoiced\r\n\r\n-----------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n★2015：TTAO169029 12'OCT15 NOKD03 AI) NAGYO NEWSPAPER (TYO-1158)\r\n\r\nDate: Monday, October 19, 2015\r\ntime: 09:00-11:00\r\nNumber of people:15+1\r\nContact Person Miss Alex de la Dure\r\nLanguage: French\r\n\r\nInspection fee: EUR 600.00 (VAT included) >>> Offer rate\r\n　　　　　EUR 543.60 (VAT included) per group >>> actual cost.　　\r\n\r\nProgram Content: Lecture\r\n- Agriculture in the Ile-de-France region (Paris region)\r\n- The role of the Chamber of Agriculture\r\n\r\n------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n▼YYJO050656-30SEP15 NOKH04 A) KEIZAI-REN NL/D/F 10D 30+1 \r\n\r\n◆Date: Tuesday, October 6, 2015, 09:30-11:00 a.m. / 11:30 a.m. (about one and a half to two hours)\r\n\r\n◆Examples of inspection programs\r\nProgram Content: Presentation and Q&A\r\n*Examples of presentation contents\r\n- Introduction of the Chamber of Agriculture\r\n- Major agricultural crops of France\r\n- Position of agriculture in France and the EU\r\n\r\n*Language: French\r\n\r\n* The office building itself closes at 12:30 during the lunch break, so the morning inspection will be until that time at the latest.\r\n\r\n◆Inspection fee (tax included):\r\nEUR550 per group including VAT per group \r\n※Invoice settlement\r\n\r\n+++Kuoni NET ++\r\nEUR543.60 per group incl VAT.\r\ninvoice after service. No Cancellation fee.\r\n\r\n------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nYYJO045195-02OCT13 NOKH04 A)CHUOKAI KEIZAIREN NL/CH/F 10 (GRQ NGO-0098) 31+1\r\n\r\nhttp://www.ile-de-france.chambagri.fr/index.php?page=caif_fonctionnement (French)\r\nhttp://www.ile-de-france.chambagri.fr/index.php?page=campaign (English)\r\n\r\nContact Person: Ms. Christine Lacaze\r\nEMAIL ADDRESS : C.LACAZE@ile-de-france.chambagri.fr\r\n\r\nDate: Tuesday, October 8, 2013, 10:00-12:00 a.m. (about 2 hours)\r\n\r\nProgram content: Lecture and Q&A.　\r\n- Lectures (the role of the Chamber of Agriculture, Île=de=Characteristics of agriculture in the French region, etc.).\r\n- Questions and answers.\r\n\r\n* The question letter can be prepared after the participant has decided, so please prepare it.　\r\n* The office building itself will be closed at 12:30 for lunch break, so the inspection will be until that time at the latest.\r\n\r\nInspection fee (tax included):\r\nEUR 502.32 per group (19.6% tax included)　\r\n⇒ VAT 19.6%, so EUR420 + VAT 19.6% EUR82.32=EUR502.32\r\n\r\n※Cancellation conditions:\r\nNo charge if you let us know at least one week in advance.\r\n= > Please be sure to inform us with plenty of time, for example, at least one month in advance.\r\n\r\n------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n◆Internal Materials/London Meetings & Events eNewsletter - Vol. 11 January 2013◆ \r\n\r\nDuring your visit to CIAI, you will learn about the agricultural situation in the region and how this very important organization is involved in the quality of rural areas and the development of rural tourism.\r\n\r\n　- Visit to CIAI\r\n　- Presentations on various agriculture-related topics\r\n　　　Description of agriculture in the surrounding area\r\n　　　Impact of policies on local agriculture, etc.\r\n　- Q&A\r\n\r\nIt is also possible to visit an actual farmer and observe the outdoor work and daily work.\r\n\r\nPlease contact us for details.\r\n\r\n-------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n★TTAO092018-24SEP12 NTAE14 A) TOCHIGI SEINEN NOGYOSHA (GRQ TYO-0681)16+1\r\n\r\nTV DATE \t: Monday 1st of October 2012\r\nTV TIME : 9.30am till 12.30pm It was popular last year, so it went from 2 hours to 3 hours.\r\nContact Person: Ms. Christine Lacaze\r\nTEL      : +33 (0)1.39.23.42.16\r\n\r\n<Program >: 09:30-12:30 (3 hours)\r\n・Presentation on the \"EU Agricultural Income Compensation System\" in the EU's general agricultural policy\r\n・Q&A\r\n\r\n* The office will be closed at 1230, so the inspection will be until that time.\r\n* It was said that 0930-1230 in the morning or 1430-1730 in the afternoon is possible, so 1230-1430 seems to be closed during the lunch break.\r\n\r\n< inspection fee (tax included): EUR 480.- per group >-\r\n* I had it extended from 2 hours to 3 hours, but I was accepted for the same price.\r\n*Since it is EUR 478.40 incl VAT/group (EUR400+78.40), the offer to AGT is rounded up.\r\n\r\n-------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n★TTAO074209-26SEP11 TKKE11 A) TOCHIGI SEINEN NOGYOSHA (GRQ TYO-0540)16+1\r\n\r\nContact Person: Ms. Christine Lacaze\r\nTEL      : +33 (0)1.39.23.42.16\r\n\r\n◆Program:　\r\n・Presentation on the \"EU Agricultural Income Compensation System\" in the EU's general agricultural policy\r\n・Q&A\r\n\r\n◆Inspection fee (tax included):\r\nEUR418.60 per group\r\n*EUR350+VAT19.6％（EUR66.60)",
