    "description": "An apple orchard in Ussy Sur Marne, a city near Paris (about 67 km from Paris).\r\n\r\nIt produces 25 kinds of apples, 7 kinds of pears, and cherries. The harvested fruit is traded in large markets such as Rungis in Paris. The farmland area is about 35 hectares.",
    "tourProgramExample": "http://www.cndp.fr/carte-des-ressources/rclvisu/fic_edit.asp?Ecr=CNDPconsult.asp&fETABL=16891\r\n\r\n---------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n★TTAO052119-27SEP10 NTAE14 A) TOCHIGI SEINEN NOGYOSHA (GRQ TYO-0374) 14+2 LEAD+TL\r\n\r\nPic:　Mr Bernard Oudard\r\n※Mr Bernard Oudard (owner) and Mr Christophe Oudard (26 years son of owner)\r\n\r\nDate of visit: October 4, 2010 (Monday) 1030-1230　\r\n◆Program: Approx. 2 hours \r\n・Explanation of orchards and crops (apples) \r\n・ Business handover to a successor and associated problems, etc.\r\n　(Mr Christophe will be present)\r\n・Commercialization of crops \r\n・Guided tours to orchards and facilities \r\n\r\n* As with last year, the main purpose of this time is to hear from the successor, so we are asking the owner's son to make time to talk as much as possible.\r\nSince it is a family business and it is difficult to respond to the child alone throughout the program, the explanation will basically be from the owner, but we will consider responding as much time as possible, such as questions and answers.\r\n\r\n◆Inspection fee (tax included)\r\nEUR 350.- Prepayment per group.\r\n\r\n---------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n★TTJO997395-10OCT'07 TKKE11 A)TOCHIGI SEINEN NOGYOSHA\r\n\r\nTime required: About 2 hours\r\n\r\n・Explanation of orchards and crops (apples)\r\n・Commercialization of crops\r\n・Guided tours to orchards and facilities\r\n\r\nIn 2007, the cost was EUR 300 per group incl. VAT.\r\nPrepayment is required.",
