    "description": "We work in cooperation with the Ministry of Agriculture, the French National Institute of Agrarian Sciences, and university research facilities. Activities include promoting the introduction of computer technology in agricultural business, providing information, designing information tracking technology, and managing agricultural products.",
    "tourProgramExample": "★2014: TTAO152564-08NOV14 A) SPK N-TOUR OBO JA TAIKI 10 \r\n\r\nDate: November 14, 2014 (Fri.) 10:30-12:30 　 \r\nNumber of people: 15 + 1 tour leader + 1 interpreter \r\nContact Person: Emilie Donnat \r\n　　　　※:149 rue de Bercy 75012 Paris,France (Meeting room = ROOM F)\r\n\r\nLanguage: French\r\nInspection fee: Free (please bring a souvenir as a thank you)\r\n\r\nProgram content: ACTA and ARVALIS joint meeting\r\n<ACTA's lecture content>\r\nOverview of the organization, ITA network, and some of the activities\r\n<Lecture by ARVALIS>\r\nAbout ARVALIS' activities and FARMSTAR's most important services for farmers\r\nTools to highlight data with traceability\r\n\r\n* ACTA can accept the group, but cannot explain ICT and traceability. It was said that ARVALIS was more suitable than ACTA in that field, so we decided to have a joint meeting with ACTA at ARVALIS.\r\n\r\n*For your information*ARVALIS is a facility with a plant-related technical laboratory specializing in agricultural computer technology.\r\nURL:http://www.arvalisinstitutduvegetal.fr/index.html (French only)\r\n\r\n---------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n<YYJO029326-01OCT08 NOKH04 A) NOKYO CHUOKAI KEIZAIREN TV (GRQ NGO-0009)> arrangement\r\n\r\nDate: October 2008\r\nPerson in charge: Mme Emiile Donnat, Mr Guy WACKSMAN (Director of the IT ACTA Department) \r\n\r\nContent: Approximately 2 hours of lecture\r\n・Introduction of traceability technology in French agriculture\r\n・ACTA Activities\r\n\r\nInspection fee: EUR 190.- (incl. VAT) for half day use as a place fee.",
