    "description": "MAN Trucks & Buses is a group company of the German automotive and machinery manufacturer MAN. We manufacture and sell commercial vehicles such as trucks and buses.\r\n\r\nThe Munich plant produces truck factories. There is also a showroom and a customer center.",
    "tourProgramExample": "<TYO-1763 ICT-RELATED VIISTS IN D> SURVEY *CXLD (IMPACT OF COVID-19)*\r\n\r\n☆ Date and time\r\n\r\nNovember 18, 2020 (Wed) 1400~ *Please arrive at least 15 minutes before the tour start time.\r\n\r\n☆Number of people\r\n\r\n25＋1\r\nFujitsu Family Association\r\n\r\n☆Contact\r\n\r\nMr. Bui Dieu \r\n(werksfuehrung-muc@man.eu / +49 (0)89 1580 3826)\r\n\r\n☆Program example\r\n\r\nPrivate Compact Tour (1.5 hours) ⇒ Considering the interpretation time, the total journey time is about 2 hours.\r\nBrief introduction, truck assembly, cabin assembly, etc.\r\nhttps://man-factory-tour.diva-agency.de/#regdl=kompakt-tour-27264 \r\n\r\nThe language of the visit is German.\r\n\r\n☆Inspection fee\r\n\r\nEUR 230 P/G (VAT included)\r\nOnly spot payment is possible\r\n\r\n☆Conditions\r\n\r\nCancellation up to 1 week before the visit is free, and full charges will be charged thereafter.\r\n\r\n☆Special Notes\r\n\r\n- Name list must be submitted at least one week prior to the tour.\r\n- Please bring your passport or other ID on the day of your visit.\r\n- For safety reasons, please wear firm shoes with closed toes.\r\n- MAN Trucks & Buses reserves the right to change the content immediately before the tour or to cancel for operational reasons. We are not responsible for any consequential damages.\r\n\r\n---------------------------------\r\n\r\n<OSA-0616 MOULDING EXPO 2019 > Survey *CXLD due to lack of customers* \r\n\r\nAs of March 2019, only the Nuremberg plant accepts external visits at MAN's plant.\r\n\r\nAs a general rule, tours of the Munich and Augsburg plants are limited to MAN bus owners and customers who come to pick up their trucks. Only when there is space, we will respond to requests from others.\r\n\r\n---------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n<TTAO229121-20NOV18 TTTB04 \"A) IWATE SANGYO COLLEGE (NOV)\" (TYO-1614)>\r\n\r\n☆ Date and time\r\n\r\nThursday, November 22, 2018 AM\r\n\r\n☆Number of people\r\n\r\nStudent 22+T/L 1+Interpretation \r\nIwate Prefectural College of Industrial Technology \r\n\r\n☆ Answer\r\n\r\nI wanted a compact tour (1.5 hours), but as of mid-October, none of the tours were available in November.\r\n\r\n---------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n<TYO-1311 BUS RELATED BIZ TVS INCH/D/I >\r\n\r\n☆ Date and time \r\n\r\nOctober 12~20, 2016 \r\n\r\n☆Number of people \r\n\r\n10-20＋1 \r\nMember organizations and company staff of the Japan Bus Association \r\n\r\n☆ Person in charge\r\n\r\nMrs. Schultz, “MAN Erlebnisf&uuml;hrungen M&uuml;nchen“ (MAN GUIDED TOURS MUNICH)\r\n\r\n☆ Answer\r\n\r\nAccepted at the Munich factory, which offers guided tours.\r\nOfficial permission will be granted after submitting your desired visit date and time, but if you let us know the desired date and time and the planned number of people, you can hold down the visit slot, and it seems that you can present the group details later.\r\n\r\nThe factory only manufactures trucks (the group wants buses), but according to the representative, the \"Exclusive Tour Traction\" program allows you to see the axle assembly line and even include a bus production story in your presentation.\r\n\r\n(\"Exclusive Tour Traction\" tour information: from the attached PDF))\r\nTakes 2.5 hours\r\nLanguages: German, English, French, Spanish\r\nPrice EUR 250 P/G\r\nNumber of people: Up to 30 people per group",
