    "description": "Discover the Lemon Tour, an experience that combines the rich farming culture of the Amalfi Coast with the ancient art of processing Amalfi's sfusato lemon. This journey reveals the many uses of the citrus fruit, from culinary delicacies to therapeutic properties, all on the Lemon Terraces.\r\n\r\nProfessionals and young students interested in citrus fruit cultivation will find this tour particularly engaging.\r\n\r\nThe tour includes a visit to the artisanal liquor factory ‘Terra di Limoni’, where it is possible to observe the production of limoncello and taste the typical local limoncello. Choose between a half-day tour with a guided walk through the lemon house and tastings, or a full-day experience that adds a delicious lemon lunch with a sea view.\r\n\r\nAll tours, including the Short Lemon Tour, offer a hands-on insight into the world of citrus cultivation and end with a special lemon box to take home.",
    "tourProgramExample": "Full-day Program\r\n\r\nAt 9:00: Meeting in Minori\r\nAt 9:45: Guided tour to the lemon garden with explanation of how to cultivate the “Amalfi Coast Lemon” I.G.P. A welcome drink will be served.\r\nAt 12:00: Visit to the collection center which cures the selection process and the manufacturing of the “Amalfi Coast Lemon” I.G.P.\r\nAt 12.30: Visit of the small craft distillery  \"Terra di Limoni\"  with presentation of the” Limoncello “ and his  production process. Traditional  liquors  tasting will be offered .\r\nAt 13.30: We will reach a sea sight terrace where a typical lemon flavored lunch will be served and some little secrets about the multiple uses of this fruit unique in the world will be  revealed, either  in the culinary and therapeutic fields.",
