    "description": "Discover a distinctive Tuscan farm surrounded by gentle hills and rich history.\r\n\r\nThe visit begins with a presentation that sets the scene for a deeper understanding of the land and its traditions. Wander through the garden where a variety of fresh vegetables grow, handpicked daily to inspire authentic culinary creations.\r\n\r\nThe guided tour offers a unique chance to explore the estate’s historic corners and natural beauty.\r\n\r\nThe Albergo Diffuso model consists of components scattered in different buildings within the same urban area to promote hamlets or towns with historical centres of great artistic and architectural interest.\r\n\r\nThis way old neglected buildings can be readapted to host tourists thus also reducing new construction initiatives. The experience ends with a relaxed lunch around a large stone table, fostering connection and exchange in a genuine atmosphere.\r\n\r\nA welcoming Q&A session rounds out the visit, making it a rich opportunity for collaboration and learning.",
