    "tourProgramExample": "<FUK-0231 AGRI & HORTICULTURAL TVs IN NL/F ( Kagoshima Prefectural College of Agriculture - Agriculture) > *CXLD* \r\n\r\n☆ Date and time \r\n\r\nTuesday, July 14, 2020 afternoon \r\n\r\n☆Number of people \r\n\r\n20-25+1+Interpretation \r\nKagoshima Prefectural University of Agriculture Department of Flowers and Vegetables \r\n\r\n☆ Desired content\r\n\r\nVisiting smart agriculture at paprika farmers \r\n\r\n☆ Answer \r\n\r\nFrom the viewpoint of preventing coronavirus infection, as of the end of March 2020, most paprika farmers and greenhouse growers will not accept external visits within the year.\r\n \r\nPlease check the acceptance status after 2021. \r\n\r\n-----------------------------------------\r\n\r\nTTAO092018-24SEP12 NTAE14 A) TOCHIGI SEINEN NOGYOSHA 16+1\r\n⇒ only \"tomato farmer\" is allowed, and I haven't visited because \"Jami CV\" was eventually possible. \r\n\r\nSupplier:\r\nMarianne / Agriexperience \r\n\r\nRe:\r\nThursday, September 27, 2012, 11.30 – 12.45\r\n\t    \r\nPIC: \r\nJohn Overgaag\r\n\r\nCost:\r\nAccording to AgriExperience 2012 rates, EUR 250 per location (per group, tax included) x 5 locations = EUR1250 (total). \r\n\r\n※Supplement※\r\nSince it is difficult to arrange a tomato farmer to fit the requested 5 types of crop farmers within the 1.5-day schedule, the \"red pepper farmer\" was proposed instead. Facility equipment, equipment and cultivation technology are the same as for tomatoes. Also, since it is a farm run by a successor, it is possible to include a meeting with the successor.",
