    "description": "A family-owned orange paprika farmer.\r\n\r\nOriginally a tomato farmer, he switched to orange paprika cultivation in 1993 in anticipation of market growth. It moved to its current location in 2000. Initially, the farmland area was 5 hectares, but in 2007 it expanded to 9 hectares.\r\n\r\nCultivation of orange paprika begins in December, and the first harvest occurs in mid-March. Leave a few days after the end of the harvest and start the next planting. This process will be repeated until mid-November. The harvested orange paprika is bagged in our own warehouse.",
    "tourProgramExample": "<FUK-0231 AGRI & HORTICULTURAL TVs IN NL/F ( Kagoshima Prefectural College of Agriculture - Agriculture) > *CXLD* \r\n\r\n☆ Date and time \r\n\r\nTuesday, July 14, 2020 afternoon \r\n\r\n☆Number of people \r\n\r\n20-25+1+Interpretation \r\nKagoshima Prefectural University of Agriculture Department of Flowers and Vegetables \r\n\r\n☆ Desired content \r\n\r\nVisiting smart agriculture at paprika farmers \r\n\r\n☆ Answer \r\n\r\nFrom the viewpoint of preventing coronavirus infection, as of the end of March 2020, most paprika farmers and greenhouse growers will not accept external visits within the year. \r\n  \r\nPlease check the acceptance status after 2021. \r\n\r\n----------------------------------\r\n\r\n<TTAO190857-01FEB'16 JTBA02 A) JTB SPK FIT HFIPO 5> \r\n\r\n☆ Date and time \r\n\r\nWednesday, February 3, 2016, 1000-1115 \r\n\r\n☆Number of people \r\n\r\n3＋1 \r\n\r\n☆ Person in charge\r\n\r\nMr. Danny van der Spek\r\n\r\n☆Program example \r\n\r\nGuided tour by a representative\r\n- Introduction to the farm \r\n- Explanation of various information (introduction of farming methods, products, greenhouses, technologies, purchase of seedlings, seasonal yields, working environment, sales channels, financing, etc.) \r\n- Greenhouse tour \r\n- Q&A \r\n\r\n☆ Price \r\n\r\nEUR 210 P/G (VAT not required) - ARRANGEMENT FEE THROUGH AGRI EXPERIENCE\r\n\r\n☆Other\r\n\r\nPaprika cultivation begins in December. Since the time of visit is still before maturity, paprika can be blue or small. \r\n\r\n----------------------------------\r\n\r\n<1361569 FUK ARROW KAGOSHIMA NODAI FLOWER VEG 2014 ( FUK-0145 )> \r\n\r\n☆ Date and time \r\n\r\nWednesday, June 25, 2014, 1400-1515/1530 \r\n\r\n☆Number of people \r\n\r\n36 students (25 from Vegetable Department+11 from Flower Department) + 1 faculty member + 1 tour conductor + 1 interpreter \r\n\r\n☆ Program \r\n\r\n>> 1st offer\r\nLecture on agriculture in the Netherlands\r\nGreenhouse tour *Due to the large number of people, it must be divided into 2 parts (2 interpreters are also required)\r\nQ&A\r\n\r\n>> 2nd offer (We don't have the budget to have multiple interpreters, so we asked for a change so that everyone could visit together)\r\n1400–1430 - Lecture\r\n1430–1450 - Greenhouse tour *Only points explained while walking\r\n1455–1515 - Questions and answers\r\n\r\n☆Inspection fee\r\n\r\n1 group (up to 40 people): EUR 280.25 (EUR 250 + tax 21%)\r\n\r\n☆Conditions\r\n\r\nCancellation up to 4 weeks in advance is free.\r\nCancellations made 4~2 weeks in advance will be charged as EUR 60.5, less than 2 weeks will be charged EUR 121, and less than 1 week cancellation charge will be charged in full.\r\nThe change costs EUR 60.5.",
    "officialWebsite": "https://www.tuinbouwcluster.nl/paprikakwekerij-van-der-Spek",
