    "description": "A dairy farm operated by Pennings in Greenheart (*) since 1930.\r\n\r\nIt has a pasture area of 33 hectares and 90 dairy cows, including calves, of which 55 are milked. (We do not use milking robots.) There is also a shop that sells in-house produced cheese using raw milk, and also sells various natural products from nearby farmers. Taking advantage of the Greenheart countryside, we also operate recreational facilities.\r\n\r\nHis son, Mr. Pennings, is working as a successor with his parents, who are now owners.\r\n\r\nGreenheart is a well-preserved central countryside of the Netherlands, located in the middle of the four major Dutch cities (Amsterdam, Rotterdam, The Hague and Utrecht).",
    "tourProgramExample": "TTAO168490-28SEP15 NTAE14 A) TOCHIGI SEINEN NOGYOSHA 14+2 Pulling Rate+1T/C\r\n\r\nRe:　\r\nWednesday, September 30, 2015, 14:00-15:15\r\n\r\nNumber:　\r\n14 + 2 chaperones + 1T/C\r\n\r\nPerson in charge:　\r\nMr Pennings\r\nTel 0031(0)252-224001 / mobile 06-22669018\r\n\r\nProgram:　\r\nFarmer visit, guided tour\r\n* My son Mr. Penings is too busy to guide you, but we ask you to attend on the day if it is convenient.\r\n★request★\r\nEmergency construction of the roof of the barn will be carried out on the day of the inspection, and for safety reasons, it will not be possible to approach, and the cows will be taken outside and grazed on the ranch. Therefore, it is no longer possible to tour the cowshed, but the content of the explanation will remain the same.\r\n\r\nLanguage:　\r\nDutch\r\n\r\nLunch arrangements:\r\nWe also had lunch arranged before the visit.\r\n13:00 - 14:00\r\nlunch 3 courses hot meal, light soup, stew, dessert.\r\n\r\nInspection fee:\r\nEUR225+21%VAT =EUR272.25 including VAT p/place \r\n\r\nLunch fee: \r\nWith Chinese lunch the day before, EUR35p/p including VAT\r\n\r\n----------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nFrom TTAO092018-24SEP12 NTAE14 A) TOCHIGI SEINEN NOGYOSHA (TYO-0681) 18+1 \r\n\r\n・Examples of inspection programs\r\n15:00-16:15 Visit to Farmer\r\n\r\n・Cost by Agri Experience\r\n@EUR250x5 locations = total EUR1250.-\r\n\r\nFor groups of up to 25 people, \r\nDue to the difficulty of arranging inspections, the tariff of EUR 250 and EUR225 per visit (including tax, per group) was unchanged for the past few years, but the number of time-consuming requests for arrangements increased, and in consideration of the increase in VAT from 19 to 21% in October 2012, it became EUR 250 per visit (per group) for all inspection destinations.",
