    "description": "A dairy farm run by Mart Duineveld.\r\n\r\n・Size: 60ha owned, 40ha leased.\r\nType of cow: mainly Holstein. Some Fleckfee species.\r\nNumber of cows: 190 dairy cows. 80 beef cattle for a local butcher shop (Belgian Blue, Red Fur Highland breed, etc.).\r\n・Raise calves in different places.\r\n・The cowshed is two rows of 12 units. No milking robots.\r\n・Father, son, and one employee\r\n(As of June 2, 2017)",
    "tourProgramExample": "*The name given by Agriexperience is \"FA. C. Duineveld en zn.\", but thereafter \"C. Duineveld en Zonen\" (C. Duineveld en zn. Duineveld and Sons).\" Originally fa. C. Duineveld en zn.= Family C. Duineveld and Sons.\r\n\r\n＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝\r\n\r\nTTAO216047-08FEB18 NOKD03 A) NOGYO NEWS PAPER (GRQ TYO-1418) 15+1 *Information only\r\n\r\n*Arranged by Agriexperience.\r\n* Milking robots were seen and farmers who also produce cheese were good, so it became Van Wees Boerenkaas.\r\n\r\nDate: Friday, February 9, 2018\r\n10.00-11.15  Dairy farm C. Duineveld en Zonen \r\n12.00-13.00  Lunch at Tomatoworld\r\n13.00-14.30  Tomatoworld\r\n\r\nDuration: 1 hour and 15 minutes\r\nProgram: Guided Tour\r\nCost: EUR295.00\r\n\r\n----------------------------------------\r\n\r\n<KKJO064633-26JUN17 NOKR60 \"A) SEINENBU HOLLAND\" ( FUK-0193 )> Arrangements *CXLD due to lack of customers* \r\n\r\n☆ Date and time \r\n\r\nThursday, June 29, 2017, 930-1045　 \r\n\r\n☆Number of people \r\n\r\n15+1+Interpretation \r\n\r\n☆ Person in charge \r\n\r\nMr. Mart Duineveld\r\n\r\n☆Program example \r\n\r\n- Introduction and tour of the facility \r\n- Q&A \r\n\r\n☆Inspection fee \r\n\r\nEUR 295 P/G (~25 people)\r\n\r\n⇒ Due to a confirmed cancellation, the supplier AGRI EXPERIENCE was charged EUR 40 P/TOUR.\r\n\r\n-----------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n★TTAO101609-02NOV12 NOKC06 A) MINAMIMAKI-MURA TOUR \r\n・Number of people: 17+1 \r\n・Inspection destination: Dairy farm fa. C. Duineveld en zn.\r\n・PIC: Mart Duineveld  \r\n・Examples of inspection programs \r\nSaturday 3 November, 2012 10.15–11.30 Farmer visit Briefing of the facility and hearing about dairy farming.\r\n\r\n・Cost by Agri Experience \r\nTotal EUR 1,775.10.- (including 21% VAT) per group at 6 locations for 3 days",
