    "description": "Opened in 1970. Today, it has an area of 70 hectares, raises about 125 dairy cows and 100 calves, has the right to produce 1 million kg of raw milk, and almost half of the rights to produce about 550,000 kg of cheese. We also cultivate and produce potatoes, sugar beets and tulips.\r\n\r\nThe cheeses produced here bear the KB label http://www.keurmerken.info/KB.html (Dutch), which is a label of high-quality controlled dairy farm products, indicating the safety of traceability of products produced from raw milk, guaranteeing quality and reliability to consumers.\r\n\r\nIn 2010, a shop was also opened selling homemade products.",
